(window.PL_LANG_Q = window.PL_LANG_Q || []).push([{"Three turns are all I need!":"3 回合就够我用了！","The referee is watching. Let us give them a good show!":"裁判正看着呢。让我们打一场精彩的对战吧！","In here, nobody switches out. It is all guts!":"在这里谁都不能换下场。全凭毅力！","I will win on points if I have to!":"必要的话，我靠评分也要赢！","My Pokémon never back down. Do yours?":"我的宝可梦从不退缩。你的呢？","Beaten fair and square...":"输得心服口服……","Even the referee could see you were better.":"连裁判都看得出你比我强。","No regrets. That was a real fight!":"没有遗憾。这才是真正的对战！","My guts were not enough this time...":"这次光靠毅力还不够……","So you are the one everybody is talking about! I am Greta, the Arena Tycoon. In my Arena, guts beat everything. Show me yours!":"原来大家都在说的人就是你！我是竞技场主将黄瓜香。在我的竞技场里，毅力胜过一切。让我看看你的毅力吧！","You again! Good, I have been waiting. This time I am giving it everything I have got!":"又是你！太好了，我一直在等你。这次我要使出全力！","Whoa, you have got guts! Fine, this is yours.":"哇，你真有毅力！好吧，这个归你了。","Ha ha! That was the best battle I have had in ages. You earned it!":"哈哈！这是我好久没打过的精彩对战。这是你应得的！","Welcome to the Battle Arena! Here, Pokémon battle one on one, three turns at a time.":"欢迎来到对战竞技场！在这里，宝可梦一对一对战，每组最多 3 回合。","Enter three Pokémon. They come out in the order you choose them, and they cannot be switched out.":"请报名 3 只宝可梦。它们会按你选择的顺序出场，中途不能替换。","If neither Pokémon has fainted after three turns, the referee judges Mind, Skill and Body. The loser is out, and the winner battles on with the HP it has left.":"如果 3 回合后双方都没有倒下，裁判就会按心、技、体来评分。输的一方出局，赢的一方带着剩下的 HP 继续对战。","Win seven in a row to finish a set and earn Battle Points. Pokémon above level 50 battle at level 50, items from the Bag cannot be used, and your Pokémon will be just as they were.":"连胜 7 场就完成一轮，可以获得对战点数。超过 50 级的宝可梦按 50 级对战，不能使用背包里的道具，你的宝可梦也不会有任何改变。","The Arena Tycoon has come to battle you herself!":"竞技场主将亲自前来和你对战了！","Greta recognizes your guts. You earned the Silver Guts Symbol!":"黄瓜香认可了你的毅力。你得到了银色毅力象征！","Greta recognizes your guts. You earned the Gold Guts Symbol!":"黄瓜香认可了你的毅力。你得到了金色毅力象征！","The door to the battle room. Challengers must register at the counter first.":"通往对战房间的门。挑战者要先在柜台报名。","Mind is about attacking without holding back. Hiding behind Protect costs you points.":"心看的是有没有全力进攻。躲在守住后面会扣分。","Skill is about hitting where it hurts. Moves that do not work well count against you.":"技看的是有没有打中要害。效果不好的招式会扣分。","Body is about the HP your Pokémon keeps. Think about the order: a winner stays in with the HP it has left.":"体看的是宝可梦保住了多少 HP。出场顺序要想清楚：赢的一方会带着剩下的 HP 继续打。","They say the Arena Tycoon herself comes out for Trainers who win twenty-eight battles in a row.":"听说连胜 28 场的训练家，竞技场主将会亲自出来和他们对战。","Mind, Skill and Body. After three turns, I judge every match-up fairly.":"心、技、体。3 回合之后，我会公正地判定每一组对决。","Welcome to the Contest Hall! Here we hold the {a} and the {b}.":"欢迎来到华丽大赛会场！这里举办{a}和{b}的比赛。","Welcome to the Contest Hall! Here we hold the {a}.":"欢迎来到华丽大赛会场！这里举办{a}的比赛。","There are three rounds. In the Visual round, the judges look at your Pokémon's condition: Pokéblocks help.":"比赛共有三个阶段。视觉审查时，评审会看宝可梦的状态：宝可方块能帮上忙。","{mon} needs the {ribbon} to enter here. It is won in the {rank} at {town}.":"{mon}需要{ribbon}才能在这里参赛。这枚奖章要在{town}的{rank}比赛中赢得。","{mon} may now enter the {rank} of the {cat} contest, held in {town}.":"{mon}现在可以参加{cat}组的{rank}了，比赛在{town}举办。","The Fearless Stride":"无畏的步伐","Light on Still Water":"静水之光","A Smile for Everyone":"给每个人的笑容","The Quiet Thinker":"沉静的思考者","Strength That Stands Firm":"屹立不倒的力量","What a performance! I paint for the Lilycove Museum. May I paint {mon} for its gallery?":"多么精彩的表演！我为水静市美术馆作画。可以让我为美术馆画下{mon}吗？","The museum has a painting in its {cat} frame already. Mine would take its place.":"美术馆的{cat}画框里已经有一幅画了。我的画会取代它。","Let the artist paint it?":"要让画家画它吗？","I understand. Win again, and I will ask again!":"我明白了。再赢一次的话，我会再来问你！","There! \"{title}\". It will hang on the second floor of the Lilycove Museum.":"画好了！《{title}》。它会挂在水静市美术馆的二楼。","An empty frame. Its plate reads: \"{cat} Contest, Master Rank.\"":"空的画框。名牌上写着：“{cat}组 大师级”。","{mon}, champion of the {cat} Contest, Master Rank. Given by {ot}.":"{mon}，{cat}组大师级冠军。由{ot}赠送。","A painting: \"{title}\". {plate}":"一幅画：《{title}》。{plate}","Every frame upstairs holds a painting now, and every one of them is your Pokémon! Please, take this as our thanks.":"楼上的每个画框都挂上画了，而且全都是你的宝可梦！请收下这个，聊表谢意。","Our second floor is complete, thanks to you. Visitors stand in front of those paintings for hours.":"托你的福，我们的二楼完整了。参观的人会在那些画前站上好几个小时。","Upstairs, {n} of the five frames hold a painting of a Master Rank champion. We hope to fill them all.":"楼上的五个画框中，已经有{n}个挂上了大师级冠军的画。希望能把它们全部挂满。","Upstairs, five frames wait for paintings of the Master Rank champions of our Contest Hall.":"楼上有五个画框，等着挂上本市华丽大赛会场大师级冠军的画。","This is the Berry Blender! Put berries in, and it makes Pokéblocks. Pokémon love them, and they make them shine in contests.":"这是树果混合器！放进树果就能做出宝可方块。宝可梦很爱吃，还能让它们在比赛中大放光彩。","{player} received a Pokéblock Case!":"{player}得到了宝可方块盒！","Use berries of different kinds. Flavors that clash cancel out, so think about what goes together!":"要用不同种类的树果。相冲的口味会互相抵消，所以想想哪些搭配得好！","Blend berries":"混合树果","Feed a Pokéblock":"喂宝可方块","Come back any time. The blender never sleeps!":"欢迎随时再来。混合器从来不休息！","You have no berries to blend. The clerk sells some.":"你没有可以放进去的树果。店员那里有卖。","Blend!":"开始混合！","In the blender: {list}":"混合器里：{list}","Your Pokéblock Case is full.":"你的宝可方块盒已经满了。","{player} made a {block}! Level {n}, feel {f}.":"{player}做出了{block}！等级{n}，细腻度{f}。","Your Pokéblock Case is empty. Blend some first!":"你的宝可方块盒是空的。先做一些吧！","{block} Lv. {n}":"{block} Lv. {n}","Which Pokéblock?":"哪一块宝可方块？","{mon} can't eat any more Pokéblocks.":"{mon}已经吃不下宝可方块了。","{mon} ate the {block}!":"{mon}吃了{block}！","Plain berries, perfect for the Berry Blender!":"普通的树果，最适合放进树果混合器！","Blender host":"混合器负责人","Curator":"馆长","My first contest was here! Win the Normal Rank, then try the Super Rank in Fallarbor Town.":"我第一次参赛就是在这里！先赢下普通级，再去秋叶镇挑战超级级别吧。","Never put two of the same berry in the blender: the Pokéblock comes out black. For Beauty, a Chesto Berry with an Oran Berry makes a fine blue one.":"千万别把两颗一样的树果放进混合器：做出来的宝可方块会是黑色的。想提升美丽的话，零余果配橙橙果能做出很好的蓝色方块。","Pokéblocks raise a Pokémon's condition, but it can only eat so many. Make every one count!":"宝可方块能提升宝可梦的状态，可是能吃的数量有限。每一块都要用得值得！","I paint the champions of the Master Rank for the Lilycove Museum. Win one, and I will ask to paint your Pokémon!":"我为水静市美术馆画大师级的冠军。只要你赢下一场，我就会请求画你的宝可梦！","The Master Rank! Only Pokémon with a Hyper Rank ribbon in the same category may enter.":"大师级！只有拥有同一组别高级级别奖章的宝可梦才能参加。","This floor shows paintings of Pokémon that won the Master Rank at the Contest Hall. One frame for each category.":"这一层展出在华丽大赛会场赢得大师级的宝可梦的画。每个组别一个画框。","A poster: \"Normal Rank contests, every day! Show the judges what your Pokémon can do.\"":"海报：“普通级比赛，每天举行！让评审看看你的宝可梦有多厉害。”","A poster: \"Super Rank contests. Only Pokémon that won the Normal Rank may enter.\"":"海报：“超级级别比赛。只有赢过普通级的宝可梦才能参加。”","A poster: \"A Pokémon in fine condition shines from the very first round.\"":"海报：“状态好的宝可梦，从第一个阶段就会大放光彩。”","A poster: \"Hyper Rank and Master Rank contests. The best Pokémon in Hoenn compete here.\"":"海报：“高级级别与大师级比赛。丰缘最出色的宝可梦在这里一较高下。”","A poster: \"Master Rank champions are painted for the Lilycove Museum.\"":"海报：“大师级冠军的画像会挂进水静市美术馆。”","My name is Steven. I am interested in rare stones, so I travel all over looking for them.":"我叫大吾。我对稀有的石头很感兴趣，所以到处旅行寻找它们。","These caves hold stones you will not find anywhere else. Is that not wonderful?":"这些洞窟里有在别处找不到的石头。很棒吧？","My name is Steven. I am interested in rare stones... Oh? A letter for me?":"我叫大吾。我对稀有的石头很感兴趣……哦？有我的信？","{player} handed over the Letter.":"{player}交出了信。","From my father? ...Thank you for bringing it all this way. And I hear you got the Devon Goods back, too.":"是我父亲写的？……谢谢你特地送来。听说你还把得文货物抢回来了。","You seem like a Trainer who will go far. Please take this TM. Steel Wing: hard wings that strike like steel.":"你看起来是会大有作为的训练家。请收下这个招式学习器。钢翼：用像钢铁一样坚硬的翅膀攻击。","I have more stones to look for. Maybe we will meet again somewhere. Take care.":"我还有别的石头要找。说不定我们会在哪里再见。保重。","Slateport City is to the north, across the sea. Mr. Briney can take you there, I bet.":"凯那市在北边的海对面。哈奇老人一定能载你过去。","Mr. Briney's boat cut through the waves, with Peeko flying beside it...":"哈奇老人的船破浪前进，Peeko在一旁飞着……","You already have a fishing rod! Cast it in any water and see what bites.":"你已经有钓竿了！随便找片水域甩下去，看看会钓到什么吧。","Fishing is the best! Here, take this Old Rod and see for yourself.":"钓鱼最棒了！来，拿着这根破旧钓竿，自己试试看吧。","Face the water, use the rod, and wait for a bite!":"面对水面用钓竿，然后等鱼上钩！","Yo, Champion! Brawly uses Fighting-type Pokémon. They hit Normal and Rock types hard.":"嘿，冠军！藤树用的是格斗属性的宝可梦。它们对一般和岩石属性很有效。","Flying and Psychic moves are the way to go. A Taillow from Route 104 or a Wingull from the beach would do great!":"飞行和超能力属性的招式最好用。104号道路的傲骨燕或海边的长翅鸥都很合适！","With one Hoenn badge, your Pokémon from home listen up to level 25. Win this one and it goes up to 30!":"有一枚丰缘徽章，你从家乡带来的宝可梦在25级以下会听话。赢下这枚就会提高到30级！","Here you go: the Knuckle Badge. You earned it, no question.":"给你：拳头徽章。这是你应得的，没话说。","{player} received the Knuckle Badge from Brawly!":"{player}从藤树那里得到了拳头徽章！","With two Hoenn badges, Pokémon up to level 30 will obey you, even ones from far away.":"有了两枚丰缘徽章，30级以下的宝可梦都会听你的话，就算是从远方来的也一样。","Take this too. TM08 is Bulk Up: it raises your Pokémon's Attack and Defense. Great for riding out a storm!":"这个也给你。招式学习器08是健美：能提高宝可梦的攻击和防御。顶住暴风雨正合适！","Brawly surfs the big waves around the island every morning. That is how he trains!":"藤树每天早上都在岛周围冲大浪。那就是他的修行方式！","West along the beach is Granite Cave. A young man in a fancy suit went in there to look at rocks.":"沿着海滩往西就是石之洞窟。有个穿着讲究的年轻人进去看石头了。","Everyone in Dewford Hall is always talking about the newest trend. I can never keep up!":"武斗镇会馆里的人总在聊最新的流行。我根本跟不上！","There is no Mart on this island. Stock up on Potions before you take a boat over!":"这座岛上没有友好商店。坐船过来之前要先备好伤药！","Welcome to Dewford Hall! Here we talk about whatever is popular. This week? Rare stones, of all things!":"欢迎来到武斗镇会馆！我们在这里聊各种流行的话题。这星期？竟然是稀有的石头！","They say the walls of Granite Cave hold an ancient picture of a huge Pokémon. Spooky!":"听说石之洞窟的墙上有一幅古老的画，画着一只巨大的宝可梦。好可怕！","Laura":"劳拉","Body and mind, trained as one! That is how we fight in Brawly's Gym!":"身心合一地修行！这就是藤树道馆的战斗方式！","My focus slipped...":"我分心了……","Meditite trains its mind by meditating. Its strength comes from inside.":"玛沙那靠冥想锻炼心灵。它的力量来自内心。","Takao":"高尾","Hoo... hah...":"呼……哈……","Brawly learned his moves riding the big waves. His Pokémon never give up.":"藤树是在大浪里练出这些招式的。他的宝可梦从不放弃。","Yo! I am Brawly, Dewford's Gym Leader. I have ridden the roughest waves around this island, and they made me strong. A Champion from Kanto, huh? Let us see if you can handle a big swell!":"哟！我是武斗镇道馆的馆主藤树。我在这座岛周围冲过最猛的浪，是大浪让我变强的。关都来的冠军是吧？让我看看你能不能顶住大浪！","Whoa, you swallowed my wave whole! You really are something.":"哇，我的大浪全被你吞掉了！你真的很了不起。","Shh! You will scare the fish. ...Too late. Battle me, then!":"嘘！你会把鱼吓跑的。……来不及了。那就跟我对战吧！","The one that got away...":"让它跑掉了……","The sea around Dewford is rough. Only strong Pokémon live out there.":"武斗镇周围的海很凶。只有强壮的宝可梦才住得下去。","Granite Cave is dark inside, deeper down. A Pokémon that knows Flash will light your way.":"石之洞窟深处很暗。会闪光的宝可梦能帮你照亮道路。","The ladder there goes down into the dark. Somebody went down earlier, muttering about stones...":"那边的梯子通往黑暗的深处。刚才有个人一边念叨着石头一边下去了……","Dennis":"丹尼斯","Granite Cave is my favourite place in all of Hoenn! Battle me in its honour!":"石之洞窟是我在丰缘最喜欢的地方！为了它，跟我对战吧！","My Pokémon are as hard as granite... but you are harder.":"我的宝可梦跟花岗岩一样硬……可是你更硬。","Aron eats iron ore from the cave walls. Do not let it near your bike!":"可可多拉会吃洞窟墙上的铁矿石。别让它靠近你的自行车！","Joyce":"乔伊斯","I train down here in the dark to sharpen my senses. Hyah!":"我在这片黑暗里修行，磨练自己的感官。嘿呀！","Brawly's Gym is my goal. I will beat him one day!":"我的目标是藤树的道馆。总有一天我会打败他！","Dewford Town. A tiny island in the rough sea, with a big Gym.":"武斗镇。汹涌海中的小岛，有一座大道馆。","Dewford Town Pokémon Gym. Leader: Brawly, a big wave of fighting spirit.":"武斗镇宝可梦道馆。馆主：藤树，斗志如巨浪般汹涌。","Granite Cave. Visitors must watch their step in the dark.":"石之洞窟。来访者在黑暗中请注意脚下。","Ahoy! Peeko and I owe you one. Where shall we sail?":"喂！我和Peeko欠你一个人情。要开船去哪里？","Here we are! Just say the word when you want to sail again.":"到了！想再出海的时候说一声就好。","First round":"第一轮","Quarterfinal":"八强赛","Semifinal":"准决赛","The crowd is watching. Let us make it a match to remember!":"观众都在看着。让我们打一场难忘的比赛吧！","I read your data. I know what you will send out!":"我看过你的资料了。我知道你会派谁出场！","Only one of us goes on to the next round!":"我们之中只有一个人能晋级！","This tournament is mine!":"这次冠军赛是我的！","I have waited all season for this match.":"这场比赛我等了整整一季。","You go on to the next round. Good luck!":"你晋级了。祝你好运！","So that is why you are ranked where you are...":"原来这就是你排名那么高的原因……","My tournament ends here...":"我的冠军赛就到此为止了……","Win the whole thing for me, will you?":"替我拿下冠军吧，好吗？","Welcome to the stage, challenger! I am Tucker, the Dome Ace, and this crowd came to see a show. Let us give them one!":"欢迎登上舞台，挑战者！我是巨蛋超级巨星石南，观众们是来看精彩表演的。让我们好好表演一场吧！","The crowd is roaring for you this time! But the star of this Dome is still me!":"这次观众都在为你欢呼！不过这座巨蛋的巨星依然是我！","Bravo! The crowd loves you. This is yours, champion.":"精彩！观众都爱上你了。这个归你了，冠军。","What a finale! Today the Dome has a new star.":"多么精彩的决赛！今天，巨蛋诞生了新的巨星。","Favors tricky status moves.":"擅长使用变化招式。","Favors all-out attacks.":"擅长全力进攻。","Mixes attacks and tricks.":"攻守平衡。","Rank {rank}. {style} Trained for {stat}.":"排名第 {rank}。{style}主要能力：{stat}。","Welcome to the Battle Dome! Here, sixteen Trainers battle in a tournament.":"欢迎来到对战巨蛋！在这里，16 位训练家会进行淘汰赛。","Enter three Pokémon. Before each match, you choose two of them to battle.":"请报名 3 只宝可梦。每场比赛前，从中选 2 只出战。","Win four matches in a row to become the champion and earn Battle Points. Before each match, you may look at the tournament tree and at your opponent's data.":"连赢 4 场就能成为冠军，获得对战点数。每场比赛前，可以查看对阵表和对手的资料。","Tournaments won in a row: {n}. Your best: {best}.":"连续夺冠次数：{n}。最佳纪录：{best}。","{round}: your opponent is {foe}.":"{round}：你的对手是{foe}。","What will you do?":"要怎么做？","Opponent's data":"对手资料","You retired from the tournament.":"你退出了这次冠军赛。","In the final, the Dome Ace takes the stage himself!":"决赛中，巨蛋超级巨星亲自登场了！","You are out of the tournament. Please try again!":"你被淘汰了。请再接再厉！","You won! On to the next round.":"你赢了！进入下一轮。","Congratulations! You won the tournament!":"恭喜！你拿下了冠军！","Tucker recognizes your tactics. You earned the Silver Tactics Symbol!":"石南认可了你的战术。你得到了银色战术象征！","Tucker recognizes your tactics. You earned the Gold Tactics Symbol!":"石南认可了你的战术。你得到了金色战术象征！","Look at the tournament tree before each match. The better ranked Trainers usually win their way through, but not always.":"每场比赛前看看对阵表吧。排名高的训练家通常会晋级，不过也不一定。","Your opponent's data shows their three Pokémon. They will send out the two that do best against yours, so choose your two well.":"对手资料里能看到他们的 3 只宝可梦。他们会派出最能克制你的 2 只，所以你也要好好挑选。","They say the Dome Ace himself waits in the final of every fifth tournament for a Trainer who keeps winning.":"听说对于一直赢下去的训练家，巨蛋超级巨星会在每第 5 次冠军赛的决赛里亲自等着。","Ross":"罗斯","Vince":"文斯","Jamal":"贾马尔","Tess":"苔丝","Welcome to the Battle Dome! This counter is for the double battle tournament.":"欢迎来到对战巨蛋！这个柜台负责双打淘汰赛。","Enter three Pokémon. Before each match, you choose two of them, and both battle at once in a double battle.":"请报名 3 只宝可梦。每场比赛前从中选两只，两只会一起上场进行双打。","Only in the single battle tournament, mind you. In the double battle tournament, your two Pokémon fight side by side against two.":"不过只限单打淘汰赛哦。在双打淘汰赛里，你的两只宝可梦会并肩对抗对手的两只。","Rented Pokémon, rented luck. Let us see whose choices were better!":"租来的宝可梦，租来的运气。来看看谁选得更好吧！","I picked my team in under a minute. That is all I needed!":"我不到一分钟就选好了队伍。这样就够了！","You do not know my Pokémon, and I do not know yours. Fair enough!":"你不了解我的宝可梦，我也不了解你的。很公平！","A good Trainer can win with any Pokémon. Prove it!":"好的训练家用什么宝可梦都能赢。证明给我看吧！","I have studied every rental in this place. Ready?":"这里的每一只租借宝可梦我都研究过了。准备好了吗？","Your picks were better than mine...":"你选得比我好……","You made those rentals look like your own.":"那些租来的宝可梦在你手上，就像是你自己的一样。","I should have chosen differently...":"我应该选别的才对……","Well played. Maybe you would like one of mine?":"打得漂亮。要不要换一只我的宝可梦？","So you are the one winning with rentals! I am Noland, the Factory Head. Here, knowing Pokémon matters more than owning them. Let me see what you know!":"原来用租借宝可梦连连获胜的就是你！我是工厂头目达拉。在这里，了解宝可梦比拥有宝可梦更重要。让我看看你懂多少吧！","Back again? This time I thought it all through. My rentals are ready for you!":"又来了？这次我可是全都想好了。我的租借宝可梦已经准备好了！","Ha! You really know your Pokémon. You earned this.":"哈！你是真的很了解宝可梦。这是你应得的。","Amazing... There is nothing left I can teach you about Pokémon.":"了不起……关于宝可梦，我已经没有什么能教你的了。","{mon} holding {item}: {moves}.":"{mon}（携带{item}）：{moves}。","Choose rental Pokémon {k} of {n}.":"请选择第 {k} 只租借宝可梦（共 {n} 只）。","Will you battle with these Pokémon?":"要用这些宝可梦出战吗？","Would you like to swap one of your Pokémon for one your opponent used?":"要不要用你的一只宝可梦，换一只对手刚才用过的宝可梦？","No thanks":"不用了","Give up":"交出","Which Pokémon will you give up?":"要交出哪只宝可梦？","Which Pokémon will you take?":"要换来哪只宝可梦？","{old} went back to the Factory, and {mon} joined your team.":"{old}回到了工厂，{mon}加入了你的队伍。","Welcome to the Battle Factory! This counter is for double battles.":"欢迎来到对战工厂！这里是双打对战的柜台。","Welcome to the Battle Factory! This counter is for single battles.":"欢迎来到对战工厂！这里是单打对战的柜台。","Here, you battle with rented Pokémon. Out of the six we offer, choose three for single battles, or four for double battles.":"在这里要用租借的宝可梦对战。从我们提供的 6 只里，单打选 3 只，双打选 4 只。","After each win, you may swap one of your Pokémon for one that your opponent used.":"每赢一场，你都可以用自己的一只宝可梦，换一只对手用过的宝可梦。","Win seven in a row to finish a set and earn Battle Points. The more you win, the stronger the rentals and your opponents become.":"连胜 7 场就完成一轮，可以获得对战点数。赢得越多，租借宝可梦和对手就会越强。","These are the six Pokémon we can rent to you.":"这些是我们可以租给你的 6 只宝可梦。","The Factory Head has come to battle you himself!":"工厂头目亲自前来和你对战了！","Noland recognizes your knowledge. You earned the Silver Knowledge Symbol!":"达拉认可了你的知识。你得到了银色知识象征！","Noland recognizes your knowledge. You earned the Gold Knowledge Symbol!":"达拉认可了你的知识。你得到了金色知识象征！","Your rentals go back to the Factory. Next time, you will rent new ones and start from battle No. {n}.":"租借的宝可梦要还给工厂了。下次你会租到新的宝可梦，并从第 {n} 场开始。","Nobody here battles with their own Pokémon. What wins at the Battle Factory is knowing what each rental can do.":"这里没有人用自己的宝可梦对战。在对战工厂，能赢的是了解每只租借宝可梦能做什么的人。","Read the moves and the held item of each Pokémon before you rent it. And after a win, the Pokémon you just beat may be better than one of yours!":"租借之前，先看看每只宝可梦的招式和携带的道具。还有，赢了之后，刚被你打败的宝可梦说不定比你手上的更好哦！","They say the Factory Head battles in person against Trainers who win twenty-one single battles in a row.":"听说单打连胜 21 场的训练家，工厂头目会亲自出来和他们对战。","Please, give it back! That meteorite is the fruit of years of my research!":"求求你们还给我！那块陨石是我多年研究的成果啊！","Research? Professor, this stone holds more power than you know. Poured into the volcano, it will make the land grow, and people need more land to live on.":"研究？博士，这块石头蕴藏的力量远超你的想象。把它的能量注入火山，陆地就会扩张，而人们需要更多的土地来生活。","Boss! A kid followed us in here!":"老大！有个小鬼跟着我们进来了！","So you are the child who keeps meddling with Team Aqua. I am Maxie, the leader of Team Magma. The land will grow, and nobody will stop it.":"原来你就是一直在跟海洋队纠缠的那个小孩。我是熔岩队的首领赤焰松。陆地终将扩张，谁也阻止不了。","Maxie! I knew we would find you here.":"赤焰松！我就知道会在这里找到你。","Archie. Late, as always. The meteorite is ours. Team Magma, to Mt. Chimney!":"水梧桐，还是一样慢吞吞。陨石已经是我们的了。熔岩队，前往烟囱山！","Team Magma wants to make the land bigger by heating up the volcano. If they get their way, the sea will shrink! That I will never allow.":"熔岩队想加热火山，让陆地变大。要是让他们得逞，大海就会缩小！我绝不允许。","Kid, they are heading for the top of Mt. Chimney. Their grunts will not be guarding the cable car on Route 112 any more. We are going too!":"小鬼，他们要去烟囱山顶。112号道路缆车那里不会再有他们的手下看守了。我们也走！","My meteorite... I thought they wanted to help with my research. I will go home to Fallarbor and wait. I hope somebody can get it back...":"我的陨石……我还以为他们是想帮忙我的研究。我回秋叶镇的家等着吧。希望有人能把它拿回来……","Go-Goggles! Those would keep the sand out of your eyes. But the storm is so wild today that nobody can even find the path. Better wait until it dies down.":"是ＧＯＧＯ护目镜！有了它沙子就不会进眼睛了。不过今天沙暴大得连路都找不到。还是等它小一点再说吧。","A sandstorm rages in the desert ahead. Without goggles, the sand would blind you after a few steps.":"前面的沙漠刮着沙暴。没有护目镜的话，走不了几步眼睛就会被沙子迷住。","My husband came home looking so sad. Those people in red took his precious meteorite...":"我丈夫回来的时候好伤心。那些穿红衣服的人抢走了他珍贵的陨石……","Some people in red hoods asked my husband to take them to Meteor Falls. He was so happy that someone cared about his research...":"有几个戴红色兜帽的人请我丈夫带他们去流星瀑布。终于有人关心他的研究，他高兴得不得了……","Meteor Falls is north-west of town, past Route 114.":"流星瀑布在镇子的西北边，穿过114号道路就到。","Thank you again. I will keep studying this meteorite, and one day I will learn where it came from.":"再次谢谢你。我会继续研究这块陨石，总有一天会弄清楚它是从哪里来的。","Is that... my meteorite? You brought it back from Mt. Chimney!":"这是……我的陨石？你把它从烟囱山带回来了！","{player} gave the meteorite back to Professor Cozmo.":"{player}把陨石还给了Cozmo博士。","Thank you! Please, take this. It is TM27, Return: the more a Pokémon loves its Trainer, the harder it hits.":"谢谢你！请收下这个。这是招式学习器27，报恩：宝可梦越喜欢训练家，威力就越大。","They took my meteorite up Mt. Chimney... What could they want with it? I study the sky, not volcanoes...":"他们把我的陨石带上烟囱山了……他们到底想拿它做什么？我研究的是天空，又不是火山……","Welcome to the Mt. Chimney Cable Car! Shall we take you up to the summit?":"欢迎乘坐烟囱山缆车！要送您到山顶吗？","The cable car swayed gently as it climbed the steep side of Mt. Chimney...":"缆车轻轻摇晃着，沿着烟囱山陡峭的山坡往上爬……","This is the summit of Mt. Chimney. Please watch your step: the ground is hot!":"这里是烟囱山的山顶。请小心脚下：地面很烫！","Professor Cozmo":"Cozmo博士","Cozmo's Wife":"Cozmo博士的妻子","Attendant":"工作人员","Travis":"崔维斯","I camped right by the desert last night. Sand got into everything, even my battle plans!":"昨晚我就在沙漠边露营。沙子钻进了所有东西里，连我的对战计划都是！","Buried in the sand...":"被沙子埋了……","Sandshrew loves the desert. It curls up into a ball when the sandstorm gets too strong.":"穿山鼠最喜欢沙漠了。沙暴太强的时候，它会把身体蜷成一团。","Irene":"艾琳","A picnic is no fun without a battle first!":"野餐之前不先对战一场就没意思了！","My sandwiches went flat...":"我的三明治被压扁了……","Mt. Chimney is to the west. I would love a picnic at the top, but they say the cable car is closed.":"烟囱山在西边。真想去山顶野餐，可是听说缆车停开了。","Hayden":"海登","My flames burn hotter than the desert sun!":"我的火焰比沙漠的太阳还要炽热！","Snuffed out...":"被扑灭了……","Fire types love the heat around Mt. Chimney. Lavaridge Town, at its foot, has the hottest Gym in Hoenn.":"火属性宝可梦最喜欢烟囱山一带的热气了。山脚下的釜炎镇有丰缘最火热的道馆。","Slipped off the trail...":"从山路上滑下来了……","Mt. Chimney is a volcano, you know. The Fiery Path goes right through it to the other side.":"烟囱山可是一座火山哦。火焰小径直接穿过山体通到另一边。","Trent":"特伦特","I carried these Pokémon up a hundred mountains. Now they can carry me to victory!":"我背着这些宝可梦爬过上百座山。现在轮到它们带我走向胜利了！","What a rockslide...":"真是一场山崩……","The ledge to the west comes down from Lavaridge Town. You cannot climb back up that way.":"西边的崖坡是从釜炎镇下来的。从那里是爬不回去的。","Team Magma is using the cable car today. Nobody else goes up the mountain!":"今天缆车被熔岩队包下了。其他人一律不准上山！","Our boss went off to Meteor Falls with some professor... Hey, forget I said that!":"我们老大跟一个博士去流星瀑布了……喂，当我没说！","Phew, it is hot! Steam comes up through the rock everywhere. Grimer and Koffing love the fumes in here.":"呼，好热！岩石里到处都在冒蒸汽。臭泥和瓦斯弹最喜欢这里的烟了。","Lawrence":"劳伦斯","The ash on this road is warm and soft. Perfect for a battle!":"这条路上的火山灰又暖又软。最适合对战了！","Covered in ash...":"满身都是灰……","Spinda's spots are different on every single one. No two are alike!":"每只晃晃斑的斑点都不一样。找不到两只相同的！","Sophie":"苏菲","Ash fell in my lunch box again. Now I am in a bad mood. Battle!":"火山灰又掉进我的便当里了。我现在心情很差。来对战！","Not my day at all...":"今天真倒霉……","Fallarbor Town is just west of here. Its Pokémon Center is a good place to shake off the ash.":"秋叶镇就在西边。去那里的宝可梦中心抖掉身上的火山灰吧。","Jaylen":"杰伦","My bird Pokémon fly right through the falling ash!":"我的鸟宝可梦能直接穿过飘落的火山灰飞行！","Swablu's wings are as soft as cotton. It loves to sit on people's heads.":"青绵鸟的翅膀像棉花一样柔软。它最喜欢停在人的头上。","The ash from Mt. Chimney makes our fields rich. Everything grows well here!":"烟囱山的火山灰让我们的田地很肥沃。这里种什么都长得好！","Professor Cozmo lives in the house by the fields. He studies meteorites: stones that fell from the sky!":"Cozmo博士住在田边的那栋房子里。他研究陨石，就是从天上掉下来的石头！","West of town, Route 114 leads to Meteor Falls. They say a shower of falling stars made the falls long ago.":"从镇子往西，114号道路通往流星瀑布。据说很久以前是一场流星雨造就了那片瀑布。","Travellers pass through Fallarbor on their way to Meteor Falls. Everyone wants to see the place where the stars fell.":"去流星瀑布的旅人都会经过秋叶镇。大家都想看看星星坠落的地方。","Ash gets in everywhere here, even inside the Mart. They sweep three times a day!":"这里火山灰无孔不入，连商店里面都有。店员一天要扫三次地！","Pokémon Contests are held in the hall across the road: Pokémon show off how cool or cute they are. It is closed for now, though.":"马路对面的会场会举办华丽大赛：宝可梦在那里展示自己有多帅气或多可爱。不过现在暂时关闭了。","The river here is full of fish, and my Pokémon are full of fight!":"这条河里全是鱼，我的宝可梦也全是斗志！","Barboach hides in the mud at the bottom of the river. They say it can feel an earthquake before it comes.":"泥泥鳅躲在河底的泥巴里。听说它能在地震来临前就感觉到。","I am on my way to Meteor Falls, to see where the stars came down!":"我正要去流星瀑布，看看星星落下的地方！","I am seeing stars...":"眼冒金星……","Meteor Falls is through the cave mouth to the north-west. Bring sturdy boots!":"流星瀑布在西北边的洞口里面。记得穿双结实的鞋！","I was picking flowers by the river. A battle first, though!":"我正在河边摘花。不过先来对战吧！","My flowers got trampled...":"我的花被踩烂了……","Lotad likes to float down the river and nap in the sun.":"莲叶童子喜欢顺着河水漂流，在阳光下打瞌睡。","North: the desert. A sandstorm blows there day and night, so the road is closed for now.":"北：沙漠。那里日夜刮着沙暴，道路目前封闭。","Route 111. South: Mauville City. West: Route 112 and Mt. Chimney.":"111号道路。南：紫堇市。西：112号道路和烟囱山。","Route 112. East: Route 111. North: the Mt. Chimney Cable Car and the Fiery Path.":"112号道路。东：111号道路。北：烟囱山缆车和火焰小径。","Mt. Chimney Cable Car. To the summit in a few minutes!":"烟囱山缆车。几分钟就能到山顶！","The Fiery Path. It is hot inside: mind your step!":"火焰小径。里面很热：请小心脚下！","Route 113. West: Fallarbor Town. Ash from Mt. Chimney falls on this road all year round.":"113号道路。西：秋叶镇。烟囱山的火山灰一年到头都落在这条路上。","Fallarbor Town. A quiet farming town where the ash falls like soft snow.":"秋叶镇。火山灰如细雪般飘落的宁静农村。","Pokémon Contest Hall. The stage where Pokémon show off their charm.":"宝可梦华丽大赛会场。宝可梦展现魅力的舞台。","Route 114. East: Fallarbor Town. North-west: Meteor Falls.":"114号道路。东：秋叶镇。西北：流星瀑布。","The sandstorm died down when the weather went back to normal. With goggles on, you can cross the desert now.":"天气恢复正常以后，沙暴也减弱了。现在戴上护目镜，就能穿过沙漠了。","Glass Workshop. We turn the ash of Route 113 into glass.":"玻璃工房。我们把113号道路的火山灰做成玻璃。","{player}! I heard you chased Team Aqua out of the Weather Institute. Dad will be so impressed!":"{player}！听说你把海洋队赶出了天气研究所。爸爸一定会很佩服的！","I have been training hard since Route 110. This time I am going to win for real!":"从110号道路之后我一直在努力训练。这次我一定要赢！","Still not enough... You and your Pokémon really are a team.":"还是不够……你和你的宝可梦真是好搭档。","I won! I knew all that training would pay off!":"我赢了！我就知道训练不会白费！","Fortree City is just up ahead. Its Gym Leader, Winona, flies like the wind. Good luck!":"茵郁市就在前面了。那里的道馆馆主娜琪飞得像风一样快。祝你好运！","Team Aqua does not need this place any more. We know how to call the rain now... Let's go!":"海洋队已经用不着这里了。我们已经知道怎么召唤雨水了……走吧！","Thank you! They wanted our research on rain and storms... I dread to think what they mean to do with it.":"谢谢你！他们想要我们关于降雨和暴风雨的研究……真不敢想象他们打算拿来做什么。","Please, take this Pokémon as thanks. It is Castform: its form changes with the weather!":"请收下这只宝可梦作为谢礼。它是飘浮泡泡：它的样子会随着天气改变！","Thank you for saving the institute! We can get back to our forecasts now.":"谢谢你救了研究所！我们终于可以回去做天气预报了。","Team Aqua burst in and took over! They want our research on rain and storms... The chief is upstairs!":"海洋队闯进来把这里占领了！他们想要我们关于降雨和暴风雨的研究……所长在楼上！","Castform changes its form with the weather: sunshine, rain or hail. It is a weather forecast with a face!":"飘浮泡泡会随着天气改变样子：晴天、雨天或冰雹。简直就是长了脸的天气预报！","Help! That woman says Team Aqua will use our research to bring endless rain!":"救命！那个女人说海洋队要用我们的研究带来下不完的雨！","Team Aqua is borrowing this place. Scram!":"海洋队征用这里了。滚开！","Our Admin is upstairs. She will deal with you!":"我们的干部在楼上。她会收拾你的！","The weather data in here is just what our boss needs. Keep out!":"这里的气象数据正是我们老大需要的。别进来！","Tch...":"啧……","With the sea and the rain on our side, Team Aqua cannot lose!":"有大海和雨水站在我们这边，海洋队不可能输！","You made it up here? Then you will have to get past me!":"你居然上来了？那你得先过我这关！","Shelly will not go easy on you. She never does.":"阿泉可不会手下留情。她从来不会。","Ahaha! So you are the brat who keeps getting in Team Aqua's way. The research in this place is ours now: we need to know how to bring the rain!":"啊哈哈！原来你就是老在妨碍海洋队的小鬼。这里的研究现在归我们了：我们得知道怎么把雨召来！","Ahaha... I lost? Fine. We have what we came for anyway.":"啊哈哈……我输了？算了。反正我们要的东西已经到手了。","{player}! Good timing. Something I cannot see is blocking this bridge. Watch...":"{player}！来得正好。有个看不见的东西挡在桥上。你看……","Steven held up the Devon Scope. An invisible Pokémon appeared on the bridge!":"大吾举起了得文侦测镜。一只看不见的宝可梦出现在桥上了！","That was a Kecleon. It changes the colour of its body to blend into whatever is around it.":"那是变隐龙。它会改变身体的颜色，和周围融为一体。","This Devon Scope was made by my father's company. I have a feeling you will need it more than I do. Take it.":"这个得文侦测镜是我父亲的公司做的。我觉得你会比我更需要它。拿去吧。","Use it on anything that blocks your way but cannot be seen. Until next time, {player}!":"遇到看不见却挡住去路的东西，就用它吧。下次见，{player}！","Something you cannot see is standing in the doorway. You cannot get past it.":"有个看不见的东西挡在门口。你过不去。","{player} used the Devon Scope! A Kecleon was hiding in the doorway!":"{player}使用了得文侦测镜！原来有只变隐龙躲在门口！","The way into the Gym is clear now.":"现在可以进入道馆了。","The sky over Hoenn is wide. I hope you keep flying higher, {player}.":"丰缘的天空很辽阔。希望你能越飞越高，{player}。","Yo, Champion! Winona uses Flying-type Pokémon. Electric, Ice and Rock moves will bring them back down to earth!":"嘿，冠军！娜琪用的是飞行属性的宝可梦。电、冰和岩石属性的招式能把它们打回地面！","Careful with her Altaria: it is part Dragon, and it knows Earthquake!":"小心她的七夕青鸟：它也是龙属性，而且会地震！","Please take the Feather Badge. You earned it in the most beautiful battle I have had in a long time.":"请收下羽翼徽章。这是我很久以来最美妙的一场对战，你赢得了它。","{player} received the Feather Badge from Winona!":"{player}从娜琪那里得到了羽翼徽章！","With six Hoenn badges, Pokémon up to level 60 will obey you, wherever they come from.":"有了六枚丰缘徽章，60级以下的宝可梦都会听你的话，不管它们来自哪里。","And this is TM40, Aerial Ace. It strikes so fast that it never misses.":"这是招式学习器40，燕返。出招快得绝不会落空。","I am Winona, the Leader of the Fortree Gym. My bird Pokémon and I have soared through the skies together for years. Let us see if you can keep up!":"我是茵郁道馆的馆主娜琪。我和我的鸟宝可梦已经一起翱翔天空好多年了。看看你能不能跟得上吧！","You flew higher than I ever imagined. I have never seen a Trainer guide their Pokémon so gracefully.":"你飞得比我想象的还要高。我从没见过能如此优雅地指挥宝可梦的训练家。","Institute Chief":"研究所所长","Hugh":"休","The rain hardly ever stops on Route 119. My birds do not mind one bit!":"119号道路几乎天天下雨。我的鸟宝可梦一点也不在乎！","Soaked through...":"全身湿透了……","Tropius grows fruit around its neck. Children in the south love to eat it!":"热带龙的脖子上会长出果实。南方的孩子们最爱吃了！","This grass is so tall I can barely see you. Good thing my Zangoose can!":"这里的草高得我都快看不见你了。还好我的猫鼬斩看得见！","Lost in the grass...":"迷失在草丛里……","Zangoose and Seviper have been enemies forever. They fight whenever they meet.":"猫鼬斩和饭匙蛇自古以来就是死对头。一碰面就打起来。","Shh! The fish are biting... Oh, all right, a battle first.":"嘘！鱼正在上钩……唉，好吧，先对战。","They all got away...":"全都跑掉了……","They say a rare fish hides in this river. It only bites in a few special spots.":"听说这条河里藏着一种稀有的鱼。只有在少数几个地方才钓得到。","Gwen":"格温","I came to see the Weather Institute. Want to battle in the rain?":"我是来参观天气研究所的。要不要在雨中对战？","My umbrella blew away...":"我的伞被吹走了……","The scientists at the Weather Institute can tell you what the weather will be tomorrow!":"天气研究所的科学家能告诉你明天的天气！","Everyone in Fortree lives up in the trees. The view from my window is amazing!":"茵郁市的人都住在树上。从我家窗户看出去的风景超棒！","Something is wrong with the Gym. Whenever I try to go in, I bump into thin air!":"道馆怪怪的。我每次想进去，都会撞到空气！","East of town, Route 120 crosses a river on a long bridge. A young man with silver hair went that way.":"从城镇往东，120号道路有一座长桥跨过河流。一个银发的年轻人往那边去了。","Winona flies with her bird Pokémon every morning. She looks so free up there.":"娜琪每天早上都和她的鸟宝可梦一起飞翔。她在天上看起来好自由。","Flying types are weak to Electric, Ice and Rock moves. Keep that in mind before you visit the Gym!":"飞行属性怕电、冰和岩石属性的招式。去道馆之前记住这一点！","Revive brings a fainted Pokémon back to the fight. Do not leave home without one!":"活力碎片能让昏厥的宝可梦重新战斗。出门一定要带一个！","This house is built around the trunk of a great tree. When the wind blows, the whole house sways a little.":"这栋房子是绕着一棵大树的树干盖的。风一吹，整栋房子都会轻轻摇晃。","Kecleon can change colours to blend into anything around it. Some say they hide right in the middle of town!":"变隐龙能变色，和周围的任何东西融为一体。听说有的就躲在城镇正中央！","Winona taught us to battle like the wind. Let me show you!":"娜琪教我们像风一样对战。让我展示给你看！","Blown off course...":"被吹偏了……","Winona never loses her calm, even when her Pokémon are in trouble. That is what makes her strong.":"娜琪就算宝可梦陷入困境也从不慌张。这正是她强大的地方。","Darius":"达瑞斯","My Pokémon read the wind before they take off. Can you read it too?":"我的宝可梦起飞前会先看风向。你也会看吗？","The wind turned...":"风向变了……","Xatu stares at the sun all day. They say it can see the future in it.":"天然鸟整天盯着太阳。听说它能从太阳里看见未来。","Humberto":"胡贝托","Skarmory's wings are as hard as steel. Your attacks will just bounce off!":"盔甲鸟的翅膀像钢铁一样坚硬。你的攻击只会被弹开！","Feathers of steel, and still...":"明明是钢铁的羽毛……","Skarmory is part Steel. Fire and Electric moves are what it fears most.":"盔甲鸟也是钢属性。它最怕的是火和电属性的招式。","Jennifer":"珍妮弗","I love the river under this bridge. Let us battle beside it!":"我最喜欢这座桥下的河了。我们就在河边对战吧！","Splash...":"扑通……","If you look closely at the bridge, sometimes it looks like the air is shimmering...":"仔细看那座桥的话，有时候好像空气在闪烁……","Colin":"科林","My birds saw you coming from all the way across the river!":"我的鸟宝可梦从河对岸就看到你过来了！","Grounded again...":"又被打落地面了……","Natu cannot fly very well yet. It hops from branch to branch instead.":"天然雀还飞不太好。它会在树枝间跳来跳去。","Route 119. South: Route 118. North: Fortree City.":"119号道路。南：118号道路。北：茵郁市。","Weather Institute. Studying the skies of Hoenn, rain or shine.":"天气研究所。不论晴雨，研究丰缘的天空。","Fortree City. A city of homes built high up among the trees.":"茵郁市。房子都建在高高树上的城市。","Fortree City Pokémon Gym. Leader: Winona, who rides the wind with her bird Pokémon.":"茵郁市宝可梦道馆。馆主：娜琪，与鸟宝可梦一同乘风翱翔的人。","Route 120. West: Fortree City. Over the bridge, the road turns south.":"120号道路。西：茵郁市。过了桥，道路转向南方。","South: Route 121, to Lilycove City.":"南：121号道路，通往水静市。","Ancient Tomb. Nobody remembers who built it, or what sleeps inside.":"古代墓穴。没有人记得是谁建造了它，也不知道里面沉睡着什么。","Glassblower":"玻璃工匠","Mt. Chimney drops its ash on this road every single day. Everyone else sweeps it away. I melt it down and blow it into glass!":"烟囱山每天都把火山灰洒在这条路上。别人都把灰扫掉，我却把它熔化，吹成玻璃！","If you want something made, bring me ash. Here, collect it in this.":"想让我做点东西的话，就把火山灰带来。来，用这个收集吧。","Walk through the ashy grass outside and the ash drops right into the sack. Come back when it feels heavy.":"走过外面积了火山灰的草丛，灰就会掉进袋子里。等袋子沉甸甸的时候再回来吧。","No Soot Sack, no ash. And no ash, no glass!":"没有集灰袋就没有火山灰，没有火山灰就没有玻璃！","Let me have a look in that sack of yours...":"让我看看你的袋子……","Hardly any ash in here yet. Walk {n} more steps through the ashy grass and I can make you a {item}.":"里面几乎没有灰。再在积灰的草丛里走{n}步，我就能帮你做{item}了。","Now that is a fine heap of ash!":"这可是一大堆火山灰啊！","{item} ({n} steps of ash)":"{item}（{n}步的灰）","What shall I make for you?":"要我帮你做什么呢？","Nothing? Your ash will keep. Come back when you have made up your mind.":"什么都不要吗？你的灰我会留着，想好了再来吧。","A {item} takes the ash of {n} steps. You need {left} more. Pick something else?":"做{item}要{n}步的灰，你还差{left}步。要换别的吗？","A {item}, for the ash of {n} steps. Shall I make it?":"{item}，要用{n}步的灰。要做吗？","Leave it to me!":"交给我吧！","There! Freshly blown, still warm from the fire.":"好了！刚吹好的，还带着炉火的温度呢。","Blowing into a glass flute makes the clearest sound you ever heard. One day I will make my own!":"吹玻璃哨会发出你听过最清亮的声音。总有一天我要自己做一个！","So you followed us all the way up here. Look: the meteorite is already in the machine.":"你居然一路跟到这里来了。看吧：陨石已经装进机器里了。","Its energy will stir the magma deep below. The volcano will pour new land into the sea, and people will finally have room to live!":"它的能量会搅动地底深处的岩浆。火山会把新的陆地倾泻进大海，人们终于能有地方生活了！","I will not let a child stand in the way of that. Come!":"我不会让一个小孩挡住这一切。来吧！","Beaten by a child... Perhaps our plan was not as ready as I believed.":"居然输给了一个小孩……看来我们的计划还没有我想的那么周全。","Keep the meteorite. Team Magma has no use for it... for now. Team Magma, we are leaving!":"陨石你拿去吧。熔岩队暂时……用不着它了。熔岩队，撤退！","You beat Maxie? Ha! Not bad at all, kid. Team Magma ran off down the mountain.":"你打败了赤焰松？哈！真不赖嘛，小鬼。熔岩队已经逃下山了。","But do not think Team Aqua owes you anything. The sea is our business. Stay out of it!":"不过别以为海洋队欠你什么。大海是我们的事。你少插手！","Is the Egg keeping warm? The hot sand gave it a good start, I am sure.":"蛋还暖和吗？热沙子一定让它有了个好开始。","I found this Egg warming itself in the hot sand. I am too old to raise a Pokémon. Would you take it?":"我发现这颗蛋在热沙子里取暖。我年纪太大，养不了宝可梦了。你愿意收下它吗？","Take the Egg?":"要收下蛋吗？","Oh well. It is quite cosy where it is.":"那好吧。它在那里也挺舒服的。","Keep it with you as you travel, and it will hatch before long.":"旅行时把它带在身边，它很快就会孵化的。","{player}! You beat Flannery? That makes four Hoenn badges already!":"{player}！你打败亚莎了？这样就已经有四枚丰缘的徽章了！","Dad asked me to give you these. They are Go-Goggles: with them you can face the sandstorm in the desert on Route 111.":"爸爸让我把这个交给你。这是ＧＯＧＯ护目镜：戴上它就能抵挡111号道路沙漠里的沙暴。","Oh, and with four badges you can challenge Norman, the Gym Leader of Petalburg City. They say he is the toughest yet!":"对了，有四枚徽章就能挑战橙华市的道馆馆主千里了。听说他是目前最强的！","I am off to look for more Pokémon. See you around, {player}!":"我要去找更多宝可梦了。再见，{player}！","I will keep training until I am a Leader everyone can count on. Come back and battle me again sometime!":"我会继续努力，直到成为大家都能依靠的道馆馆主。有空再来和我对战吧！","Hold it right there! The boss is busy, and I, Tabitha, will not let you near him!":"站住！老大正忙着，我火村绝不会让你靠近他！","Hmph... The boss will not go down so easily.":"哼……老大可没那么容易被打倒。","Shall we take you back down to Route 112?":"要送您回112号道路吗？","The cable car glided down the side of the mountain...":"缆车顺着山坡缓缓滑下……","We have arrived at the foot of Mt. Chimney. Please come again!":"我们已经到达烟囱山山脚。欢迎再次乘坐！","Please enjoy the view from the summit!":"请尽情欣赏山顶的风景！","Yo, Champion! Flannery's Gym is full of Fire types. Water, Ground and Rock types will keep you cool in here!":"嘿，冠军！亚莎的道馆全是火属性的宝可梦。水、地面和岩石属性能让你在这里保持冷静！","Watch out for Sunny Day: in the sunshine, Fire moves burn even hotter and Water moves lose their punch.":"小心大晴天：阳光下，火属性招式会更猛烈，水属性招式则会变弱。","A Grass type would have a rough time here. If your partner is a Grovyle, bring a friend who can stand the heat!":"草属性在这里会很辛苦。如果你的搭档是森林蜥蜴，记得带个耐热的伙伴！","Here, the Heat Badge. You earned it fair and square!":"给你，火热徽章。这是你堂堂正正赢来的！","{player} received the Heat Badge from Flannery!":"{player}从亚莎那里得到了火热徽章！","With four Hoenn badges, Pokémon up to level 40 will obey you, wherever they come from.":"有了四枚丰缘徽章，40级以下的宝可梦都会听你的话，不管它们来自哪里。","Take this too: TM50, Overheat. It is the hottest Fire move there is, but it leaves the user worn out afterwards.":"这个也给你：招式学习器50，过热。这是最炽热的火属性招式，不过用完之后会很疲惫。","Old Woman":"老奶奶","You came up on the cable car? Too bad: Team Magma owns this mountain today!":"你是坐缆车上来的？可惜：今天这座山是熔岩队的地盘！","Melted...":"熔化了……","The boss says the meteorite will wake up the volcano. Then the land will grow and grow!":"老大说陨石会唤醒火山。然后陆地就会越来越大！","Not one step closer to the crater! The boss is busy!":"不准再靠近火山口一步！老大正忙着呢！","Too hot to handle...":"太烫了，招架不住……","Team Aqua thinks the sea should cover everything. We know better: people need land!":"海洋队以为大海应该淹没一切。我们才明白：人们需要的是陆地！","Go on, then. See what the boss thinks of you.":"那你就去吧。看看老大怎么收拾你。","Maxie is up by the crater with that meteorite. We will keep his grunts busy: go and stop him!":"赤焰松拿着那块陨石在火山口那边。我们来拖住他的手下：你快去阻止他！","Leave this one to me! Go!":"这家伙交给我！快去！","Team Aqua, always in the way! ...Hey, you too?":"海洋队总是碍事！……喂，你也来了？","On a clear day you can see half of Hoenn from up here. Lavaridge Town is down the Jagged Pass, to the south.":"天气晴朗时，从这里能看到半个丰缘。往南走下凹凸山道就是釜炎镇。","Eric":"埃里克","Going down is harder on the knees than going up! Let me rest them with a battle.":"下山比上山更伤膝盖！让我用一场对战歇歇脚。","My knees gave out...":"膝盖撑不住了……","Mind the ledges. Once you jump down, there is no climbing back up.":"小心崖坡。一旦跳下去就爬不回来了。","Autumn":"秋子","The hot springs in Lavaridge are waiting for me, but you are in my way!":"釜炎镇的温泉在等我，可是你挡住我的路了！","I need a long soak now...":"现在我需要好好泡个澡……","Spoink bounces on its tail all day long. They say it never stops, not even to sleep!":"跳跳猪一整天都用尾巴蹦跳。听说它从来不停下来，连睡觉都不停！","Ahh... Being buried in the warm sand does wonders for old bones. You should try it!":"啊……把身体埋在热沙里，对老骨头可好了。你也该试试！","People come from all over Hoenn for these hot springs. Even Pokémon love the warm sand!":"大家从丰缘各地来泡这里的温泉。连宝可梦都喜欢温暖的沙子！","Flannery only just became the Gym Leader. Her grandfather was the Leader before her!":"亚莎才刚当上道馆馆主。在她之前，馆主是她的爷爷！","The road east goes down a ledge to Route 112. From there you can take the cable car up Mt. Chimney again.":"往东的路顺着崖坡下到112号道路。从那里可以再搭缆车上烟囱山。","After a battle, a soak in the hot springs and a rest at the Pokémon Center. That is the Lavaridge way!":"对战之后泡个温泉，再去宝可梦中心休息。这就是釜炎镇的生活方式！","Burn Heal is a must if you are going to battle Flannery. A burn saps your Pokémon's strength every turn!":"要挑战亚莎的话一定要带灼伤药。灼伤每回合都会消耗宝可梦的体力！","My grandfather used to say Mt. Chimney sleeps with one eye open. As long as nobody pokes it, it stays quiet.":"我爷爷常说，烟囱山是睁着一只眼睛睡觉的。只要没人去惹它，它就会安安静静的。","Cole":"科尔","Feel the heat? This Gym is hotter than the hot springs outside!":"感觉到热了吗？这座道馆比外面的温泉还热！","I got burned...":"我被烫伤了……","Flannery's Pokémon love the sunshine. When the sun is out, their Fire moves get even stronger.":"亚莎的宝可梦最喜欢阳光了。出太阳的时候，它们的火属性招式会变得更强。","Gerald":"杰拉德","I came here to train in the heat. Let us see if you can take it!":"我来这里是为了在高温中修行。看看你受不受得了！","You kept your cool...":"你还真沉得住气……","Torkoal puffs out black smoke when it is angry. It does not like having its stats lowered, either.":"煤炭龟生气时会喷出黑烟。它也不喜欢自己的能力被降低。","Jace":"杰斯","Flannery is fired up today. You will have to get through me first!":"亚莎今天斗志高昂。你得先过我这一关！","Burned out...":"燃烧殆尽了……","Flannery tries to act tough, but she is really kind. She just took over the Gym from her grandfather.":"亚莎总是装出一副很凶的样子，其实她人很好。她刚从爷爷手上接下道馆。","Welcome! I am Flannery, the Leader of this Gym. I only just took over... but my Fire Pokémon and I will not hold back. Let us heat things up!":"欢迎！我是这座道馆的馆主亚莎。我才刚接手……不过我和我的火属性宝可梦可不会手下留情。让气氛热起来吧！","Oh... I tried so hard to act like a proper Leader. Maybe I should just be myself. You battled beautifully!":"唉……我拼命想表现得像个真正的馆主。也许我该做回自己才对。你打得真漂亮！","A machine Team Magma left behind. There is an empty slot in it, just the size of a meteorite.":"熔岩队留下的机器。上面有个空槽，大小刚好能放下一块陨石。","Mt. Chimney. South: the Jagged Pass, down to Lavaridge Town.":"烟囱山。南：凹凸山道，下山通往釜炎镇。","The Jagged Pass. A steep, rocky path down to Lavaridge Town. There is no climbing back up!":"凹凸山道。陡峭多石的山路，通往山下的釜炎镇。下去就上不来了！","Lavaridge Town. Hot springs bubble up at the foot of Mt. Chimney.":"釜炎镇。温泉在烟囱山脚下汩汩涌出。","Lavaridge Town Pokémon Gym. Leader: Flannery, whose battles are as hot as the springs!":"釜炎镇宝可梦道馆。馆主：亚莎，她的对战就像温泉一样火热！","Go on, {player}. I will keep training here. Someday I will make it to the Champion too!":"去吧，{player}。我会继续在这里修行。总有一天，我也要走到冠军面前！","{player}! I knew I would catch up with you here.":"{player}！我就知道能在这里追上你。","Since our battle in Mauville, I have trained every single day. My body is stronger now, and so are my Pokémon. We came through all of Victory Road!":"自从在紫堇市和你对战以后，我每天都在修行。现在我的身体变强了，我的宝可梦也是。我们走完了整条冠军之路！","Before you challenge the League, I want to know how far I have come. {player}, please battle me!":"在你挑战联盟之前，我想知道自己成长了多少。{player}，请和我对战吧！","...I lost. But I am not sad. I can see now how strong you really are.":"……我输了。但我并不难过。现在我终于明白你到底有多强了。","Go on, {player}. The League is right outside. I will cheer for you!":"去吧，{player}。联盟就在外面。我会为你加油的！","Welcome, {player}. I have been waiting for you since that day in Sootopolis.":"欢迎你，{player}。自从那天在琉璃市以后，我就一直在等你。","I am Wallace, the Champion of the Hoenn region. The bond you share with your Pokémon was enough to calm the sky itself. Now let me see it with my own eyes, here at the summit!":"我是丰缘地区的冠军米可利。你和宝可梦之间的羁绊，连天空都能平息。现在，就在这巅峰之上，让我亲眼见识一下吧！","...It is over. You and your Pokémon are truly beautiful together. From today, you are Hoenn's Champion.":"……结束了。你和你的宝可梦在一起，真的非常美丽。从今天起，你就是丰缘的冠军了。","Come with me. The Hall of Fame is waiting to remember you and your team.":"跟我来吧。殿堂正等着记住你和你的队伍。","Back again, Champion? My Pokémon have grown even more graceful. Let us dance once more!":"又来了吗，冠军？我的宝可梦变得更加优雅了。再来共舞一曲吧！","Still the Champion, and still beautiful. I will be waiting for the next time.":"依然是冠军，依然那么美丽。我会等着下一次的。","The names of Hoenn's Champions and their Pokémon are kept here forever. Today, yours join them.":"丰缘历代冠军和他们的宝可梦的名字，会永远留在这里。今天，你们的名字也加入了。","The land, the sea and the sky of Hoenn are at peace, thanks to you. Go home and rest, Champion. You have earned it.":"多亏了你，丰缘的大地、大海和天空都恢复了平静。回家好好休息吧，冠军。这是你应得的。","Go on. Phoebe is next, and she has a few spooky friends waiting for you.":"去吧。下一个是芙蓉，她有几个吓人的朋友在等着你。","Glacia waits in the next room. Wrap up warm!":"波妮在下一个房间等着你。多穿点衣服吧！","The last of the Elite Four is Drake. He sailed the seas for many years. Be ready.":"四天王的最后一位是源治。他在海上航行了很多年。做好准备吧。","Go on. The Champion is waiting beyond that door.":"去吧。冠军就在那扇门后面等着你。","Beyond this door are the Elite Four of Hoenn. You battle all four in a row, and then the Champion.":"这扇门后面就是丰缘的四天王。你要连续挑战四个人，然后是冠军。","A guard blocks the mouth of the cave: \"Only Trainers with all eight of Hoenn's badges may enter Victory Road.\"":"一个警卫挡在洞口：“只有集齐丰缘八枚徽章的训练家才能进入冠军之路。”","Victory Road is a maze of rock and water. You will need Strength, Surf and a lot of nerve.":"冠军之路是由岩石和水组成的迷宫。你需要怪力、冲浪，还有很大的勇气。","You made it through Victory Road? Then the League is right there. Good luck!":"你闯过冠军之路了？那联盟就在那边。祝你好运！","Only Trainers with all eight of Hoenn's badges may enter Victory Road. The guards check every one.":"只有集齐丰缘八枚徽章的训练家才能进入冠军之路。警卫会一枚一枚检查。","Only the strongest Trainers make it through Victory Road. Are you one of them?":"只有最强的训练家才能闯过冠军之路。你是其中之一吗？","The road goes down and across an underground river. Keep going!":"这条路会往下，穿过一条地下河。继续前进吧！","I have come so far, and I am not turning back now!":"我都走了这么远了，现在绝不会回头！","I will have to try again next year...":"只好明年再来挑战了……","Altaria's cotton wings are softer than clouds. Its Dragon moves are not, though.":"七夕青鸟的棉花翅膀比云还要柔软。不过它的龙属性招式可一点都不软。","The exit is right there, but you will have to get past me first!":"出口就在那边，不过你得先过我这一关！","So close to the League, and I lost...":"离联盟这么近，我却输了……","The League is just outside. Heal up before you go in.":"联盟就在外面。进去之前先恢复一下宝可梦吧。","Caroline":"卡罗琳","The river below Victory Road is the last test. And I am the test before it!":"冠军之路底下的河是最后的考验。而我就是那之前的考验！","You passed. With flying colours.":"你通过了。而且是满分。","Surf across the river. The ladder up to the exit is on the other side.":"用冲浪渡过河吧。通往出口的梯子在对岸。","Owen":"欧文","You crossed the river? Impressive. But can you get past me?":"你渡过河了？真厉害。不过你过得了我这关吗？","The ladder up leads to the last stretch of Victory Road.":"往上的梯子通往冠军之路的最后一段。","Hoenn's Elite Four use Dark, Ghost, Ice and Dragon Pokémon. And the Champion? Nobody ever says.":"丰缘的四天王用的是恶、幽灵、冰和龙属性的宝可梦。那冠军呢？从来没有人说过。","Sidney of the Elite Four, at your service. You have got a fire in your eyes. Good! Let us have a battle nobody here will ever forget!":"我是四天王的花月，请多指教。你眼里燃着火焰呢。很好！来一场谁都忘不了的对战吧！","Well, look at that. You beat me fair and square.":"哎呀，你看看。你堂堂正正地赢了我。","Back again, Champion? My Dark Pokémon have been itching for a rematch!":"又来了吗，冠军？我的恶属性宝可梦早就等不及要再战一场了！","I am Phoebe of the Elite Four. I trained on Mt. Pyre, where the spirits rest, and my Ghost Pokémon and I share a bond deeper than words. Can you feel it?":"我是四天王的芙蓉。我在灵魂安息的送神山修行过，我和幽灵宝可梦之间的羁绊深得无法用言语形容。你感受得到吗？","Oh... I lost. The bond between you and your Pokémon is strong too.":"哦……我输了。你和宝可梦之间的羁绊也很强呢。","Welcome back, Champion. My Ghost Pokémon remember you well...":"欢迎回来，冠军。我的幽灵宝可梦都还记得你呢……","I am Glacia of the Elite Four. I came to Hoenn looking for a Trainer whose fire could melt my ice. So far, none has. Will you be the first?":"我是四天王的波妮。我来到丰缘，是为了寻找能用热情融化我的冰的训练家。到现在还没有一个人做到。你会是第一个吗？","Such passion... Your fire melted my ice after all.":"好强的热情……你的火焰终究还是融化了我的冰。","Champion. Has your fire grown hotter? My ice has only grown colder.":"冠军。你的火焰变得更炽热了吗？我的冰可是变得更冷了。","I am Drake, the last of the Elite Four. To command Dragons, a Trainer needs a heart that is both strong and kind. Do you have one? Show me!":"我是四天王的最后一位，源治。要驾驭龙，训练家需要一颗既坚强又温柔的心。你有吗？让我看看！","Superb! You have earned the right to face the Champion.":"精彩！你赢得了挑战冠军的资格。","So, the Champion returns. My Dragons have grown fiercer. Show me your heart once again!":"冠军又回来了啊。我的龙变得更加凶猛了。再让我看看你的心吧！","Ever Grande City. The city of flowers and sea, where the best Trainers of Hoenn come to challenge the League.":"彩幽市。花与海之城，丰缘最强的训练家们都来这里挑战联盟。","A shelf of records: the names of every Champion of Hoenn's Pokémon League.":"一排记录架：上面写着丰缘宝可梦联盟历代冠军的名字。","The Hall of Fame. Hoenn's Champions and their Pokémon are remembered here forever.":"殿堂。丰缘的冠军和他们的宝可梦将在这里被永远铭记。","Groudon, Kyogre, Latias and Latios: every legend of Hoenn's land, sea and sky has met you now.":"固拉多、盖欧卡、拉帝亚斯和拉帝欧斯：丰缘的大地、海洋与天空的传说，都已经与你相遇了。","Every reading is calm now. The land and the sea of Hoenn are at rest.":"现在所有的读数都很平稳。丰缘的大地与海洋都安静下来了。","The skies have been calm since Rayquaza came down. Our instruments say it is still up there, watching from the Sky Pillar.":"自从烈空坐降临以后，天空就一直很平静。仪器显示它还在高处，从天空柱上守望着。","These readings are strange! A fierce drought around Route 114, and rain that never stops over Route 127.":"这些读数好奇怪！114号道路一带严重干旱，127号道路上空却下着停不了的雨。","It is just like the day Groudon and Kyogre woke. Could the two of them be resting somewhere near there?":"这和固拉多与盖欧卡醒来的那天一模一样。难道它们就在那附近休息吗？","{player}, welcome home, Champion! You have to hear this: the news just showed a Pokémon soaring over Hoenn, faster than a jet!":"{player}，欢迎回家，冠军！你一定要听听这个：新闻刚刚播出一只宝可梦飞过丰缘的天空，比喷气机还快！","The picture was all a blur, but its color stood out. Did you see it on TV too?":"画面糊成一片，不过它的颜色很显眼。你也在电视上看到了吗？","What color was the Pokémon?":"那只宝可梦是什么颜色的？","A blue one? Then it must have been {mon}! They say it is still flying all over Hoenn. Keep your eyes open on the routes!":"蓝色的？那一定是{mon}！听说它还在丰缘各地飞来飞去。在道路上要多留意哦！","A red one? Then it must have been {mon}! They say it is still flying all over Hoenn. Keep your eyes open on the routes!":"红色的？那一定是{mon}！听说它还在丰缘各地飞来飞去。在道路上要多留意哦！","Oh, and this came in the mail for you: a ticket with a picture of an island on it.":"对了，有你的信：一张画着小岛的船票。","The sailors at the harbor in Lilycove City would know where it goes.":"水静市港口的水手应该知道它通往哪里。","The Pokémon by the great tree turns to look at you. It does not seem afraid.":"大树旁的宝可梦转过头来看着你。它似乎一点也不害怕。","Waves of heat roll off the rock. The ground itself seems to breathe... Groudon opens its eyes!":"岩石冒出阵阵热浪。大地仿佛在呼吸……固拉多睁开了眼睛！","The water of the pool swells and churns. Kyogre rises from the depths!":"水池的水翻腾涌动。盖欧卡从深处浮上来了！","A crack runs through the rock. Hot, dry air seeps out of it, but it is far too narrow to get through.":"岩石上有一道裂缝。里面渗出干燥的热风，可是太窄了，根本过不去。","A dark opening in the rock. A strong current pours out of it, too strong to swim against.":"岩石上有个黑漆漆的洞口。里面涌出强劲的水流，根本没办法逆流游进去。","The ship sailed south over the calm sea...":"船在平静的海面上向南航行……","Ready to sail back to Lilycove City?":"准备好回水静市了吗？","The ship sailed back north to Lilycove City.":"船向北航行，回到了水静市。","The ferry is running again! Where would you like to sail?":"渡轮又开始航行了！你想去哪里？","The ship sailed out to the island of the Battle Tower...":"船向对战塔所在的小岛驶去……","The ship sailed north, far beyond the seas of Hoenn...":"船向北驶去，远远离开了丰缘的海域……","Here we are: Sandgem Town, in the Sinnoh region. Mind the sand in your shoes!":"到了：神奥地区的真砂镇。小心别让沙子跑进鞋里！","Professor Rowan's lab is the big building at the north end of town. You can't miss it.":"七灶博士的研究所是镇子北边那栋大建筑，你不会错过的。","{player}! I thought I might find you here. This store has everything, doesn't it?":"{player}！我就猜会在这里遇到你。这家店什么都有，对吧？","I came to buy supplies... but a battle first! I want to see how far we have both come.":"我是来买补给的……不过先对战吧！我想看看我们俩都成长了多少。","Wow... I really thought I had you this time. You never stop surprising me.":"哇……我还以为这次能赢你呢。你总是让我大吃一惊。","I did it! I finally beat you properly!":"我做到了！终于堂堂正正地赢了你！","Dad says Team Aqua and Team Magma were seen heading for Mt. Pyre, the island south of Route 121. Be careful, {player}.":"爸爸说有人看到海洋队和熔岩队往送神山去了，就是121号道路南边的那座岛。要小心哦，{player}。","Please, stop! Those orbs must never leave this mountain!":"求求你们住手！那些宝珠绝对不能离开这座山！","Oh, it is you again. Too late, kid. The Blue Orb is coming with me. With it, the master of the sea will wake from its long sleep.":"哦，又是你啊。太迟了，小鬼。靛蓝色宝珠我带走了。有了它，海洋之主就会从漫长的沉睡中醒来。","And the Red Orb is mine. The master of the land will rise, and the land will grow. This time, Archie, we shall see whose dream comes true.":"而朱红色宝珠归我。大地之主将会苏醒，陆地将会扩张。这一次，水梧桐，就看谁的梦想能实现吧。","Ha! We will see about that, Maxie. Team Aqua, move out!":"哈！走着瞧吧，赤焰松。海洋队，撤！","Team Magma, we are leaving.":"熔岩队，撤退。","The Red Orb and the Blue Orb... they hold the hearts of the two ancient Pokémon of land and sea. Long ago, those two fought until the whole world shook.":"朱红色宝珠和靛蓝色宝珠……里面寄宿着大地与海洋的两只古代宝可梦的心。很久以前，它们俩打得整个世界都在震动。","If they are woken... no one can say what will become of Hoenn. Young one, please, do whatever you can.":"要是它们被唤醒……谁也说不准丰缘会变成什么样。年轻人，拜托你，尽你所能吧。","Welcome to the Lilycove Department Store! Poké Balls and medicine are right here. TMs and more are upstairs.":"欢迎光临水静百货公司！精灵球和药品就在这里，招式学习器等商品在楼上。","The strongest TMs in Hoenn! Each one teaches its move as often as you like.":"丰缘最强的招式学习器！每一个都能无限次教会宝可梦招式。","X items raise your Pokémon's stats during a battle. Perfect for a tough opponent!":"能力提升道具能在对战中提高宝可梦的能力。对付强敌最合适了！","Vitamins make your Pokémon stronger for good. A little expensive, but worth it!":"营养剂能让宝可梦永久变强。虽然有点贵，但很值得！","I come here every week. There is always something new on the shelves!":"我每周都会来。货架上总有新东西！","Max Potions and Full Restores cost a lot, but a Trainer heading into danger should carry a few.":"全满药和全复药虽然很贵，但要去危险地方的训练家应该带上几瓶。","TM15 is Hyper Beam! It is so strong, but my Pokémon has to rest after using it.":"招式学习器15是破坏光线！威力超强，可是用完之后我的宝可梦得休息一回合。","This cave belongs to Team Aqua! Nobody gets in. Now beat it, kid!":"这个洞窟是海洋队的！谁都不准进。快滚吧，小鬼！","The Safari Zone is closed for repairs. Please come back another time.":"狩猎地带正在整修，暂停开放。请改天再来。","Without the orbs, the mountain feels empty. I fear what those people will do with them.":"没有了宝珠，这座山感觉空荡荡的。真担心那些人会拿它们做什么。","We have guarded these orbs all our lives. They must never leave this altar.":"我们一辈子都在守护这些宝珠。它们绝不能离开这座祭坛。","The two great Pokémon have slept for a very long time. Let us pray they stay asleep.":"那两只伟大的宝可梦已经沉睡了很久很久。祈祷它们继续睡下去吧。","The Red Orb and the Blue Orb rest here, side by side, keeping the peace between land and sea.":"朱红色宝珠和靛蓝色宝珠并排安放在这里，守护着大地与海洋之间的和平。","Old Man":"老爷爷","Marcel":"马塞尔","I am training on my way to Lilycove. You will make a good warm-up!":"我在去水静市的路上修行。你正好拿来热身！","Some warm-up that was...":"这热身也太激烈了……","Lilycove has the biggest Department Store in Hoenn. Stock up before you go anywhere dangerous.":"水静市有丰缘最大的百货公司。去危险的地方之前，先在那里补给好。","Cristin":"克里斯汀","My Loudred has the loudest voice on this road. Cover your ears!":"我的爆音怪是这条路上嗓门最大的。快捂住耳朵！","Ears still ringing...":"耳朵还在嗡嗡响……","Loudred can knock over a truck with its shout. Or so it likes to think.":"爆音怪喊一声就能掀翻卡车。至少它自己是这么觉得的。","Jessica":"杰西卡","Did you see my Kecleon? No? That is because it is right behind you!":"你看到我的变隐龙了吗？没有？那是因为它就在你身后！","Seen through...":"被看穿了……","Seviper's tail is as sharp as a blade. It keeps it polished on the rocks.":"饭匙蛇的尾巴像刀刃一样锋利。它会在岩石上把尾巴磨亮。","Walter":"沃尔特","A stroll by the sea is lovely, but a battle by the sea is even better.":"在海边散步很惬意，不过在海边对战更棒。","From the beach you can see Mt. Pyre out at sea. It always seems to be covered in mist.":"从海滩上能看到海中的送神山。那里好像总是笼罩在雾里。","The Department Store has five... no, two floors! It just feels like five when you are shopping with my mum.":"百货公司有五层……不对，是两层！只是跟妈妈一起逛的时候感觉像有五层。","Lilycove is where the land runs out. Past the beach, it is nothing but sea all the way to Mossdeep City.":"水静市是陆地的尽头。过了海滩，就只有一望无际的大海，一直延伸到绿岭市。","The ferry is not running right now. Some trouble out at sea, they say. Sorry, kid.":"渡轮现在停驶了。听说海上出了点状况。抱歉啦，小鬼。","Wailmer swim into the bay at dawn. One day I will see a Wailord too: they are as big as a ship!":"吼吼鲸会在黎明时游进海湾。总有一天我也要看到吼鲸王：它们跟船一样大！","Mt. Pyre is the island you can see from the beach. People go there to remember the Pokémon who have passed away.":"从海滩上能看到的那座岛就是送神山。人们会去那里缅怀离世的宝可梦。","Welcome to the Lilycove Museum. Our gallery shows Pokémon as artists have seen them through the ages.":"欢迎来到水静美术馆。我们的展厅展示了历代艺术家眼中的宝可梦。","Ships leave Lilycove's harbour for every corner of Hoenn. When the ferry runs again, you can sail anywhere!":"从水静市的港口出发的船能开往丰缘的每个角落。等渡轮恢复了，你想去哪儿都行！","Long ago, they say, the sea and the land fought a terrible battle right here in Hoenn. The old folk on Mt. Pyre know the story.":"据说很久以前，大海和陆地就在丰缘这里打了一场可怕的仗。送神山上的老人们知道这个故事。","Gabrielle":"加布里埃尔","The spirits here are restless today... Something is happening at the summit.":"今天这里的灵魂很不安……山顶一定出了什么事。","The spirits have gone quiet...":"灵魂安静下来了……","People in red and people in blue climbed to the summit today. The spirits did not like them at all.":"今天有穿红衣服和穿蓝衣服的人爬上了山顶。灵魂们一点也不喜欢他们。","William":"威廉","I came here to meditate among the graves. My mind is clear... and ready for battle.":"我来这里在墓碑间冥想。我的心很清明……随时可以对战。","My concentration...":"我的专注力……","Kirlia can feel the happiness of its Trainer. When I am calm, it is calm too.":"奇鲁莉安能感受到训练家的快乐。我平静的时候，它也很平静。","Mt. Pyre is where people bring the Pokémon they have lost, so they can rest in peace. Walk quietly, please.":"送神山是人们安葬逝去宝可梦的地方，让它们能安息。请轻声走路。","Our boss is busy up at the altar. Turn around, kid!":"我们老大正在祭坛那边忙。小鬼，回去吧！","Sunk again...":"又沉下去了……","Once the boss has that orb, the sea will cover everything!":"只要老大拿到那颗宝珠，大海就会淹没一切！","Team Magma got here first! Well, almost first. Out of the way!":"熔岩队先到的！呃，差不多算先到。让开！","Our leader says the orb will wake the master of the land. Then you will see!":"我们首领说那颗宝珠能唤醒大地之主。到时候你就知道了！","Route 121. North: Route 120. East: Lilycove City. South, across the sea: Route 122 and Mt. Pyre.":"121号道路。北：120号道路。东：水静市。南边隔着海：122号道路和送神山。","Safari Zone. Meet the Pokémon of all Hoenn in one place!":"狩猎地带。在这里就能遇见全丰缘的宝可梦！","Lilycove City. Where the land ends and the sea begins.":"水静市。陆地的尽头，大海的起点。","Lilycove Department Store. Everything a Trainer could wish for, under one roof!":"水静百货公司。训练家想要的一切，这里应有尽有！","A painting of a Wailord leaping out of a calm sea at sunset.":"一幅画：夕阳下，一只吼鲸王从平静的海面跃起。","A painting of Mt. Pyre in the morning mist. It feels peaceful, and a little sad.":"一幅画：晨雾中的送神山。让人觉得宁静，又有点感伤。","A painting of two huge Pokémon, one of the land and one of the sea, clashing under a stormy sky. The plate reads: \"The Ancient Battle\".":"一幅画：一只大地的巨大宝可梦和一只海洋的巨大宝可梦，在暴风雨的天空下激烈交战。铭牌上写着：“远古之战”。","A sculpture of a Pokémon made of bright, curving lines. The plate has not been filled in yet.":"一座由明亮曲线构成的宝可梦雕塑。铭牌还是空白的。","A stone altar. Two hollows in it once held a red orb and a blue orb.":"一座石造祭坛。上面的两个凹槽曾经放着一颗红色宝珠和一颗蓝色宝珠。","Lois & Hal":"路易丝和哈尔","We do everything together, and that includes battles!":"我们做什么都在一起，对战也一样！","At least we lost as a team.":"至少我们是一起输的。","In a double battle, a move that hits both foes is worth twice as much. Think about it!":"在双打对战里，能同时打中两个对手的招式价值翻倍。好好想想吧！","{player}! I hear you climbed Mt. Silver and beat {rival} at the top. Ho ho! My grandson talks of nothing else.":"{player}！听说你登上了白银山，在山顶打败了{rival}。呵呵！我孙子整天都在说这件事呢。","Now, I have a letter from an old friend: Professor Birch. He studies Pokémon in the wild in Hoenn, a region far to the south.":"我这里有一封老朋友寄来的信，他是小田卷博士。他在遥远南方的丰缘地区，研究野生的宝可梦。","He is looking for a strong Trainer to help with his research, and I told him I know just the one!":"他想找一位厉害的训练家帮忙做研究，我就跟他说，我正好认识一位！","The S.S. Aqua sails from Olivine City to Hoenn now. I have put your name on her list of passengers.":"现在S.S.水神号会从浅葱市开往丰缘。我已经把你的名字写进乘客名单了。","Take the S.S. Aqua from Olivine City's pier. Professor Birch will be waiting for you in Littleroot Town.":"到浅葱市的码头搭S.S.水神号吧。小田卷博士会在未白镇等你。","Professor Oak says you are the Champion of Kanto and Johto! Here in Hoenn, though, things work a little differently.":"大木博士说你是关都和城都的冠军！不过在丰缘这里，情况有点不一样。","A Pokémon trained to a high level in another region only listens to a Trainer who has earned Hoenn's Gym badges. The more badges, the stronger the Pokémon that obey.":"在其他地区练到高等级的宝可梦，只听拥有丰缘道馆徽章的训练家的话。徽章越多，听话的宝可梦就越强。","So you will want a new partner. The Pokémon you battled with seems to like you: please, take it with you!":"所以你需要一个新伙伴。刚才和你一起战斗的宝可梦好像很喜欢你：请带它一起走吧！","{player} received {mon} from Prof. Birch!":"{player}从小田卷博士那里得到了{mon}！","My child, {rival3}, is out on Route 103, north of Oldale Town, studying Pokémon. Why not go and say hello?":"我的孩子{rival3}正在古辰镇北边的103号道路研究宝可梦。你何不过去打个招呼？","So you two have met! {rival3} has been looking forward to it for days.":"你们见过面啦！{rival3}已经期待好几天了。","{player}, may I have your Pokédex for a moment? ...There! Now it can record the Pokémon of Hoenn as well.":"{player}，能把图鉴借我一下吗？……好了！现在它也能记录丰缘的宝可梦了。","{player}'s Pokédex was upgraded!":"{player}的图鉴升级了！","And these are from me! You will need them to catch the Pokémon of Hoenn.":"这些是我送你的！要抓丰缘的宝可梦就用得着。","West of Oldale Town, Route 102 leads on to Petalburg City. Your journey through Hoenn starts there!":"从古辰镇往西，102号道路通往橙华市。你在丰缘的旅程就从那里开始！","{rival3} is on Route 103, north of Oldale Town. Go on, say hello!":"{rival3}在古辰镇北边的103号道路。去打个招呼吧！","Hoenn has Pokémon you know from Kanto and Johto, and many that live only here. Fill that Pokédex for me!":"丰缘有你在关都和城都见过的宝可梦，也有很多只住在这里的。帮我把图鉴填满吧！","Remember: the more Hoenn badges you earn, the more of your Pokémon from home will listen to you.":"记住：丰缘的徽章拿得越多，你从家乡带来的宝可梦就越听话。","The S.S. Aqua is fixed at last! She sails south to the Hoenn region now.":"S.S.水神号终于修好了！现在它会向南开往丰缘地区。","Only passengers on the list may board, though. Professor Oak in Kanto sends us their names.":"不过只有名单上的乘客才能上船。名单是关都的大木博士寄给我们的。","All aboard for Hoenn! Would you like to set sail?":"开往丰缘的船要出发了！要上船吗？","The S.S. Aqua sounded her horn and put out to sea.":"S.S.水神号鸣响汽笛，驶向大海。","The ship sailed south through the night...":"船在夜里一路往南航行……","Land ho! Welcome to Littleroot Town, in the Hoenn region.":"到岸啦！欢迎来到丰缘地区的未白镇。","Professor Birch's lab is just up the path. His family lives in the house by the north road, and they love having guests.":"小田卷博士的研究所就在这条路上去。他的家人住在北边路旁的房子里，很欢迎客人。","Come back whenever you are ready.":"准备好了再来吧。","The S.S. Aqua sails north to Olivine City in Johto. Would you like to go back?":"S.S.水神号会向北开往城都的浅葱市。要回去吗？","The ship sailed north through the night...":"船在夜里一路往北航行……","Professor Birch? He went out to do fieldwork on Route 101, north of town. He always forgets that the wild Pokémon bite!":"小田卷博士？他去镇北边的101号道路做野外调查了。他总是忘了野生宝可梦会咬人！","{player}, you look tired. Have a little rest.":"{player}，你看起来好累。稍微休息一下吧。","There! Off you go, and come home safe.":"好了！去吧，路上小心，要平安回来哦。","Oh! You must be {player}. Professor Oak wrote that you would be coming. Welcome to Littleroot!":"哎呀！你就是{player}吧。大木博士来信说你会来。欢迎来到未白镇！","You will stay with us while you are in Hoenn. Your room is upstairs, next to {rival3}'s.":"你在丰缘的时候就住在我们家吧。你的房间在楼上，就在{rival3}房间的旁边。","My husband? Out in the field, as always. Try Route 101, north of town.":"我丈夫？跟平常一样在外面做调查。去镇北边的101号道路找找看吧。","Dad says you can stay with us as long as you like. Let's both fill our Pokédex, okay?":"爸爸说你想住多久都可以。我们一起把图鉴填满吧，好不好？","Prof. Birch":"小田卷博士","Professor Birch is never in his lab. He would rather be out in the grass with the Pokémon!":"小田卷博士从来都不在研究所。他更喜欢待在草丛里和宝可梦在一起！","The S.S. Aqua docks at our little pier now. Imagine, a ship from Johto stopping in Littleroot!":"S.S.水神号现在会停靠我们的小码头。想不到吧，城都的船竟然会停在未白镇！","An old tale says Hoenn's land and sea were shaped long ago, when two great Pokémon fought over them.":"古老的传说里说，很久以前两只巨大的宝可梦为了争夺丰缘而战，大地和海洋就是那时形成的。","Some Pokémon here are from Kanto and Johto, but lots of them live only in Hoenn. I want to see them all!":"这里有些宝可梦来自关都和城都，不过很多只住在丰缘。我想全部都看一遍！","Littleroot Town. A small town where new journeys take root.":"未白镇。新的旅程在这个小镇生根发芽。","Professor Birch's Pokémon Lab.":"小田卷博士的宝可梦研究所。","Field notes: \"Many of Hoenn's Pokémon live nowhere else. Others came from far away, like the Trainers who follow them...\"":"野外调查笔记：“丰缘的许多宝可梦在别处都见不到。也有一些是从远方来的，就像追随它们的训练家一样……”","Notebooks full of drawings of Pokémon, and the places where they were seen.":"笔记本里画满了宝可梦，还有看到它们的地方。","{player}! The Champion of Hoenn, and a friend of my family. I could not be prouder!":"{player}！丰缘的冠军，也是我们家的朋友。我真是太骄傲了！","Now, an old friend of mine, Professor Rowan, studies how Pokémon evolve. He lives in Sandgem Town, in the Sinnoh region, far to the north.":"对了，我的老朋友七灶博士在研究宝可梦是怎么进化的。他住在遥远北方神奥地区的真砂镇。","He wrote that he would like to meet a Trainer who knows Kanto, Johto and Hoenn. I told him I know just the one!":"他在信上说，想见一见熟悉关都、城都和丰缘的训练家。我跟他说，我正好认识一位！","The ferry in Lilycove City's harbor sails to Sinnoh now. Professor Rowan's lab is in Sandgem Town, right by the pier.":"水静市港口的渡轮现在开往神奥了。七灶博士的研究所就在真砂镇，离码头很近。","Uncle, please! I want to challenge the Gym! Ralts and I have been training every day!":"叔叔，拜托！我想挑战道馆！我和拉鲁拉丝每天都在训练！","Wally, you only just caught your first Pokémon. A Gym Leader is a different matter.":"满充，你才刚抓到第一只宝可梦。道馆馆主可不是闹着玩的。","Oh! {player}! You are the one who helped me catch Ralts!":"啊！{player}！就是你帮我抓到拉鲁拉丝的！","Then this is the deal, Wally: battle {player}. If you can hold your own, we will talk about the Gym.":"那就这样吧，满充：跟{player}对战。要是你撑得住，我们再谈道馆的事。","All right... {player}, please battle me! I want to see how strong Ralts has become!":"好……{player}，请跟我对战！我想看看拉鲁拉丝变得多强了！","I lost... But Ralts did its best. I will train more, and one day I will catch up with you!":"我输了……不过拉鲁拉丝已经尽力了。我会更努力训练，总有一天会追上你！","That was a good battle, Wally. Come, let us go home to Verdanturf. {player}, thank you for being so kind to him.":"打得很好，满充。走吧，我们回绿荫镇。{player}，谢谢你对他这么好。","Wahahahah! Come back any time. My Gym and I will always have a jolt for you!":"哇哈哈哈！随时欢迎再来。我和我的道馆随时准备给你来一下电击！","The Game Corner is closed for renovations. \"Reopening soon!\" says a sign on the door.":"游戏城正在装修，暂停营业。门上的告示写着：“即将重新开张！”","Welcome to Rydel's Cycles! The best bikes in Hoenn, made right here!":"欢迎光临莱德自行车店！丰缘最好的自行车，就在这里制造！","Oh, you already have a Bicycle from Kanto? Then you are all set. Ride safely, and come back when you want to talk bikes!":"哦，你已经有关都的自行车了？那就没问题了。骑车注意安全，想聊自行车的时候再来吧！","Hmm, we are all sold out today. Come back another time!":"唔，今天全都卖完了。改天再来吧！","Yo, Champion! Wattson uses Electric-type Pokémon. Water and Flying types should stay away!":"嘿，冠军！铁旋用的是电属性的宝可梦。水和飞行属性的最好别上场！","Ground types do not take any damage from Electric moves. A Geodude from Granite Cave, or a Marshtomp, would laugh at this Gym!":"地面属性完全不怕电属性招式。石之洞窟的小拳石，或是沼跃鱼，在这座道馆里都能笑着过关！","Watch out for paralysis, too. Bring Paralyze Heals!":"还要小心麻痹。记得带解麻药！","Wahahahah! Take the Dynamo Badge. You earned every spark of it!":"哇哈哈哈！收下紫电徽章吧。这每一道电光都是你应得的！","{player} received the Dynamo Badge from Wattson!":"{player}从铁旋那里得到了紫电徽章！","With three Hoenn badges, Pokémon up to level 35 will obey you, wherever they come from.":"有了三枚丰缘徽章，35级以下的宝可梦都会听你的话，不管它们来自哪里。","And this one is on me: TM34, Shock Wave. An electric jolt that never misses! Wahahahah!":"这个是我送你的：招式学习器34，电击波。百发百中的电击！哇哈哈哈！","Wally's Uncle":"满充的叔叔","Mauville is the crossroads of Hoenn. Roads go out in every direction from here!":"紫堇市是丰缘的交通要道。从这里有路通往四面八方！","Wattson built a lot of this city himself. He laughs so loud you can hear him from the Pokémon Center!":"这座城市很多地方都是铁旋亲手建的。他笑得那么大声，在宝可梦中心都听得到！","The Game Corner is closed while they rebuild it. Shame, I was on a lucky streak!":"游戏城在重建，暂时关门了。真可惜，我正好手气很旺呢！","Ground types cannot be hurt by Electric moves at all. Wattson hates seeing them walk into his Gym!":"电属性招式对地面属性完全无效。铁旋最讨厌看到它们走进道馆了！","Paralyze Heal is a must against Electric types. Being paralyzed is the worst!":"对付电属性一定要带解麻药。被麻痹最惨了！","When I was young, Mauville was just a few houses at a crossroads. Then Wattson came, and the city lit up!":"我年轻时，紫堇市只是十字路口的几间房子。后来铁旋来了，整座城市就亮起来了！","My guitar and my Pokémon run on the same thing: pure electricity! Rock on!":"我的吉他和我的宝可梦靠的都是同一样东西：纯粹的电力！摇滚起来！","My strings snapped...":"弦断了……","Wattson laughs every time he battles. Win or lose, he just loves it.":"铁旋每次对战都在笑。不管输赢，他就是喜欢。","Vivian":"薇薇安","I came to this Gym to learn to fight against electricity. Let me show you what I learned!":"我来这座道馆是为了学习怎么对付电。让你看看我学到了什么！","Shocking...":"被电到了……","Magneton is three Magnemite stuck together. Its Electric and Steel types make it tough to hurt.":"三合一磁怪是三只小磁怪连在一起。它是电和钢属性，很难打伤。","Wahahahah! So you are the Champion everyone is talking about! I am Wattson, the Leader of the Mauville Gym. I will electrify you good!":"哇哈哈哈！原来你就是大家都在说的那位冠军啊！我是紫堇道馆的馆主铁旋。我要好好电你一下！","Wahahahah! Well, I was the one who got electrified! You are the real deal!":"哇哈哈哈！结果被电到的是我！你是真材实料！","Mauville City. The bright and shining city of fun!":"紫堇市。光彩夺目的欢乐之城！","Mauville City Pokémon Gym. Leader: Wattson, the cheerfully electrifying man!":"紫堇市宝可梦道馆。馆主：铁旋，快乐放电的男人！","North: Route 111, to Route 112 and Mt. Chimney.":"北：111号道路，通往112号道路和烟囱山。","West: Route 117 and Verdanturf Town.":"西：117号道路和绿荫镇。","East: Route 118. You will need a Pokémon that can Surf to cross it.":"东：118号道路。需要会冲浪的宝可梦才能渡过。","Hahaha! You came all the way down here? Too late! The boss already left in the submarine we took from Slateport!":"哈哈哈！你居然下到这里来了？太迟了！老大已经开着我们从凯那市抢来的潜水艇走了！","He is taking the Blue Orb to the bottom of the sea, to wake the master of the sea. Nothing can stop him now!":"他要把靛蓝色宝珠带到海底，唤醒海洋之主。现在谁也阻止不了他了！","Hah... whatever. You cannot catch a submarine anyway. Team Aqua, clear out!":"哼……随便啦。反正你也追不上潜水艇。海洋队，撤！","{player}, you came! Team Magma broke in. They want the rocket fuel to make Mt. Chimney erupt for good.":"{player}，你来了！熔岩队闯进来了。他们想用火箭燃料让烟囱山彻底喷发。","Here, let me heal your Pokémon first. Then let us stop them, together.":"来，我先帮你治疗宝可梦。然后我们一起阻止他们。","{player}'s Pokémon were healed!":"{player}的宝可梦恢复了！","So, you again. Rocket fuel poured into Mt. Chimney would wake the volcano for good... and the Red Orb would do the rest.":"又是你。把火箭燃料倒进烟囱山，火山就会彻底苏醒……剩下的就交给朱红色宝珠了。","...Even so, the Red Orb is mine. Team Magma, withdraw! We go where the master of the land sleeps.":"……即便如此，朱红色宝珠还在我手上。熔岩队，撤退！我们去大地之主沉睡的地方。","Thank you, {player}. The fuel is safe... but both teams now hold an orb. Something terrible is coming to Hoenn. Be ready.":"谢谢你，{player}。燃料保住了……可是两个组织现在各有一颗宝珠。有可怕的事情要降临丰缘了。做好准备吧。","Next time we will read your mind too! ...Probably.":"下次我们连你的心思也要读出来！……大概吧。","Team Magma stormed in! They are after our rocket fuel! The director is upstairs!":"熔岩队闯进来了！他们想抢我们的火箭燃料！所长在楼上！","We are getting ready for our next launch. The fuel for one rocket could light up a whole city!":"我们正在准备下一次发射。一枚火箭的燃料就能点亮整座城市！","You saved our fuel, and our launch. The whole Space Center thanks you!":"你保住了我们的燃料和发射计划。整个宇宙中心都感谢你！","Please, stop them! If that fuel ends up inside a volcano...":"求求你阻止他们！要是那些燃料被倒进火山里……","Welcome to the Space Center. One day, we hope to send a Pokémon to the stars.":"欢迎来到宇宙中心。我们希望有一天能把宝可梦送上星空。","We are two, but we battle as one. That is our strength!":"我们是两个人，却像一个人一样战斗。这就是我们的力量！","Yo, Champion! Tate and Liza battle as a pair, and their Pokémon are Psychic and Rock types. Dark, Ghost and Water moves will serve you well!":"嘿，冠军！小枫与小南是双人搭档，他们的宝可梦是超能力和岩石属性。恶、幽灵和水属性的招式会很有用！","Watch out for Solrock's Solar Beam once the sun comes out. And Claydol knows Earthquake!":"出太阳的时候要小心太阳岩的日光束。还有，念力土偶会地震！","You beat both of us at once! Here, the Mind Badge. You earned it.":"你一次打败了我们两个人！给你，心灵徽章。这是你应得的。","{player} received the Mind Badge from Tate and Liza!":"{player}从小枫与小南那里得到了心灵徽章！","With seven Hoenn badges, Pokémon up to level 70 will obey you, wherever they come from.":"有了七枚丰缘徽章，70级以下的宝可梦都会听你的话，不管它们来自哪里。","And take TM04, Calm Mind. It sharpens your Pokémon's mind: its Special Attack and Special Defense both go up.":"再拿上招式学习器04，冥想。它能让宝可梦心神集中，特攻和特防都会提高。","Oh! The Space Center... We can feel something is wrong there. Hurry!":"啊！宇宙中心……我们感觉到那里出事了。快去！","Tate & Liza":"小枫与小南","How did you find our hideout? Doesn't matter: you are not leaving!":"你怎么找到我们基地的？算了，你别想出去！","Our hideout... breached...":"我们的基地……被攻破了……","The boss is not even here. You are too late, whatever you came for!":"老大根本不在这里。不管你来干嘛，都太迟了！","Intruder! Intruder in the hideout!":"有入侵者！基地里有入侵者！","Somebody, help...":"谁来帮帮我……","Downstairs is the dock. Matt is down there. He will flatten you!":"楼下是码头。阿潮就在那里。他会把你打扁的！","You came all the way down here? Then you can go swimming with my Sharpedo!":"你居然下来了？那就跟我的巨牙鲨一起游泳吧！","I got bitten instead...":"结果被咬的是我……","The submarine was docked right here. Was.":"潜水艇本来就停在这里。本来。","Reed":"里德","The sea between Lilycove and Mossdeep is my training ground. Let me show you!":"水静市和绿岭市之间的大海就是我的训练场。让你见识一下！","I swallowed some seawater...":"呛了一口海水……","Mossdeep City is straight east. Its Space Center sends rockets up into the sky!":"一直往东就是绿岭市。那里的宇宙中心会把火箭发射到天上！","Swimming all the way to Mossdeep? Let us race... I mean, battle!":"你要一路游到绿岭市？来比赛……我是说，来对战吧！","The water around here is deep and dark in places. Some people say there is a whole world down there.":"这一带有些地方的海水又深又暗。有人说海底下藏着另一个世界。","The Space Center launches rockets from here! When one takes off, the whole island shakes.":"宇宙中心会从这里发射火箭！每次发射，整座岛都会摇晃。","The Gym Leaders are twins. They say they can read each other's minds in battle!":"这里的道馆馆主是一对双胞胎。听说他们对战时能读懂彼此的心思！","A young man named Steven lives in that house. He is always away, looking for rare stones.":"那栋房子里住着一个叫大吾的年轻人。他总是不在家，到处寻找稀有的石头。","The sea around Mossdeep is full of currents. Only good swimmers come this far.":"绿岭市周围的海流很多。只有游泳好手才能来到这里。","Psychic Pokémon are weak to Bug, Ghost and Dark moves. Rock types do not like Water or Grass, either.":"超能力属性怕虫、幽灵和恶属性的招式。岩石属性也怕水和草。","Everything here comes over by boat. That is why I always buy a little extra.":"这里的东西全靠船运过来。所以我总会多买一点。","On a clear night you can see every star from Mossdeep. The scientists say the sky is clearer here than anywhere in Hoenn.":"晴朗的夜晚，在绿岭市能看见满天繁星。科学家说这里的天空是全丰缘最清澈的。","I can read your next move! ...Probably.":"我能看穿你的下一步！……大概吧。","I did not see that coming. Literally.":"我完全没预见到。字面意义上的。","Tate and Liza do not even need to talk. They just know what the other is thinking.":"小枫和小南根本不用说话。他们就是知道对方在想什么。","Clifford":"克利福德","I come to this Gym to train my mind, not just my Pokémon. Shall we?":"我来这座道馆是为了修炼心灵，不只是训练宝可梦。开始吧？","A clear mind, and still I lost.":"心如明镜，还是输了。","Lunatone and Solrock: the moon and the sun. The twins keep one of each.":"月石和太阳岩：月亮与太阳。双胞胎各有一只。","The twins are strong, but you will have to get past me first!":"双胞胎很强，不过你得先过我这关！","My vision was clouded...":"我的预见被蒙蔽了……","Solrock shines brighter in the sunshine. Watch out if the twins call up the sun.":"太阳岩在阳光下会更耀眼。双胞胎要是召来晴天就要小心了。","We are Tate and Liza, the Leaders of this Gym! We knew you were coming: we could feel it. Our minds work as one, so you will have to beat both of us!":"我们是这座道馆的馆主小枫与小南！我们早就知道你会来：我们感觉得到。我们心意相通，所以你得同时打败我们两个！","We lost... We could read every move our Pokémon would make, but we could not read yours!":"我们输了……我们能读懂自己宝可梦的每一步，却读不懂你的！","Team Magma is borrowing this place's rocket fuel. Stay out of it!":"熔岩队要借用这里的火箭燃料。少管闲事！","Fizzled out...":"熄火了……","Our leader is upstairs. You cannot stop him now!":"我们首领在楼上。你已经阻止不了他了！","Not one step further! The fuel is ours!":"不准再往前一步！燃料是我们的！","With enough fuel, the volcano will wake for good. Then the land will grow!":"只要燃料够多，火山就会彻底苏醒。然后陆地就会扩张！","Mossdeep City. An island town where the stars feel close enough to touch.":"绿岭市。星星近得仿佛伸手可及的岛上城镇。","Mossdeep City Pokémon Gym. Leaders: Tate and Liza, twins who think as one.":"绿岭市宝可梦道馆。馆主：小枫与小南，心意相通的双胞胎。","Mossdeep Space Center. Our window on the stars.":"绿岭宇宙中心。我们眺望星空的窗口。","A letter lies on the table: \"I am off on a journey again. Whoever finds this, feel free to rest here. - Steven\"":"桌上放着一封信：“我又出门旅行了。不论是谁看到这封信，都可以在这里休息。——大吾”","{player}, welcome to my home. Thank you again for what you did at the Space Center.":"{player}，欢迎来我家。再次感谢你在宇宙中心所做的一切。","While we were busy with Team Magma, Team Aqua's submarine slipped away to the south of Mossdeep. I think they mean to go under the sea.":"我们忙着对付熔岩队的时候，海洋队的潜水艇悄悄往绿岭市南边去了。我想他们是打算潜到海底。","Take this. With it, you can follow them.":"收下这个。有了它，你就能追上他们。","HM08 is Dive. With the Mind Badge, a Pokémon that knows it can take you down from deep, dark water to the sea floor.":"秘传学习器08是潜水。有了心灵徽章，会这招的宝可梦就能带你从幽暗的深水潜到海底。","The submarine was last seen over the dark water of Route 128, south of Route 127. Be careful down there, {player}.":"最后有人看到潜水艇，是在127号道路南边、128号道路的幽暗海面上。到了下面要小心，{player}。","Rita & Sam":"丽塔和萨姆","Big sister and me, against you! Ready?":"姐姐和我一起对付你！准备好了吗？","Sis, we lost!":"姐姐，我们输了！","Some moves hit both foes at once. Surf is one of them!":"有些招式能同时打中两个对手。冲浪就是其中之一！","A letter lies on the table beside a Poké Ball: \"Congratulations, Champion. I met this Pokémon on my travels. Please look after it for me. - Steven\"":"桌上的精灵球旁边放着一封信：“恭喜你成为冠军。这是我在旅途中遇到的宝可梦。请替我好好照顾它。——大吾”","Two of them now? Then the boss and I will crush them both together!":"现在变成两个人了？那我和老大就一起把他们都打垮！","{player}, we fight them side by side. Choose three of your Pokémon, and I will bring three of mine.":"{player}，我们并肩作战吧。选出你的三只宝可梦，我也派出我的三只。","Get ready quickly, {player}. Talk to me when you are set.":"{player}，快点准备好。准备好了就来跟我说。","Maxie and Tabitha":"赤焰松和火村","My Pokémon know what to do. I just watch!":"我的宝可梦知道该怎么做。我只要看着就好！","In the Palace, you find out who your Pokémon really are.":"在宫殿里，你会看清自己的宝可梦真正是什么样子。","I trust my Pokémon completely. Do you?":"我完全信任我的宝可梦。你呢？","No orders here. Only character!":"这里没有指令，只有性格！","Let us see whose Pokémon have the stronger spirit!":"来看看谁的宝可梦精神更强大吧！","Your Pokémon have a strong spirit...":"你的宝可梦精神真坚强……","Mine did their best. I am proud of them.":"我的宝可梦已经尽力了。我为它们骄傲。","I should get to know my Pokémon better.":"我应该更了解我的宝可梦才对。","Their natures beat mine today.":"今天是它们的性格赢了。","So you are the Trainer who keeps winning in my Palace. I am Spenser, the Palace Maven. Here, Pokémon show who they truly are. Let us see yours!":"原来在我的宫殿里连连获胜的训练家就是你。我是宫殿守护者郁金。在这里，宝可梦会展现出真正的自己。让我看看你的宝可梦吧！","You have returned. Then let my Pokémon speak for me once more.":"你又来了。那就再让我的宝可梦替我说话吧。","Your Pokémon fight with heart, just as you do. Take this.":"你的宝可梦和你一样，用心在战斗。收下这个吧。","I have nothing left to teach you. Your bond with your Pokémon is the real thing.":"我已经没有什么能教你的了。你和宝可梦之间的羁绊是真的。","Welcome to the Battle Palace! Here, Pokémon choose their own moves.":"欢迎来到对战宫殿！在这里，宝可梦会自己决定用什么招式。","Enter three Pokémon. In battle you cannot give them orders: each one picks its moves as its nature tells it. You may only switch them.":"请报名 3 只宝可梦。对战中不能下指令：每只宝可梦会按自己的性格选择招式。你只能替换它们。","The Palace Maven has come to battle you himself!":"宫殿守护者亲自前来和你对战了！","Spenser recognizes your spirit. You earned the Silver Spirit Symbol!":"郁金认可了你的精神。你得到了银色精神象征！","Spenser recognizes your spirit. You earned the Gold Spirit Symbol!":"郁金认可了你的精神。你得到了金色精神象征！","In the Palace, Pokémon choose their own moves. Each one goes for attacking, defending or supporting moves, as its nature makes it want to.":"在宫殿里，宝可梦会自己选择招式。每只宝可梦会按性格，倾向于使用攻击、防守或辅助类的招式。","When its HP falls below half, many a Pokémon changes its habits completely.":"HP 降到一半以下时，很多宝可梦的习惯会完全改变。","A Pokémon that wants a kind of move it does not know may simply hesitate. Give each one moves its nature likes!":"如果宝可梦想用的那类招式它不会，它就可能只是犹豫不动。给每只宝可梦配上合它性格的招式吧！","They say the Palace Maven himself appears before Trainers who win twenty-one battles in a row.":"听说连胜 21 场的训练家，宫殿守护者会亲自出现在他们面前。","Welcome to the Battle Palace! This counter is for the double battle halls.":"欢迎来到对战宫殿！这个柜台负责双打大厅。","Enter three Pokémon. Two of them battle at once, and each one chooses its moves, and whom to hit, as its nature tells it. You may only switch them.":"请报名 3 只宝可梦。两只会同时上场，每只都会依照自己的性格决定用什么招式、攻击谁。你只能替换它们。","In the double battle halls, though, he never shows himself. There, two Pokémon fight side by side, each choosing whom to strike.":"不过在双打大厅，他从不现身。在那里，两只宝可梦并肩作战，各自决定要攻击谁。","Welcome to the Petalburg Gym. You must be the Trainer from Kanto that Professor Birch told me about.":"欢迎来到橙华道馆。你就是小田卷博士说的那位从关都来的训练家吧。","I am Norman, the Leader of this Gym. I would gladly battle a Champion, but in Hoenn I only accept challengers who hold four badges.":"我是这座道馆的馆主千里。我很想和冠军对战，不过在丰缘，我只接受拥有四枚徽章的挑战者。","Earn them, and come back. I will be waiting.":"拿到以后再来吧。我会等你的。","Um... excuse me...":"那个……打扰一下……","My name is Wally. I am not very strong, so I am going to live with my relatives in Verdanturf Town, where the air is cleaner.":"我叫满充。我身体不太好，所以要搬去绿荫镇的亲戚家住，那里的空气比较干净。","I would like a Pokémon to keep me company. But I have never caught one...":"我想要一只宝可梦陪着我。可是我从来没有抓过……","Then take my Zigzagoon and this Poké Ball, Wally.":"那就带上我的蛇纹熊和这个精灵球吧，满充。","{player}, would you go with him to Route 102 and make sure he is all right?":"{player}，你能陪他去102号道路，照看他一下吗？","Here I go... Go, Zigzagoon!":"我要上了……去吧，蛇纹熊！","A wild Ralts appeared! Wally's Zigzagoon battles it bravely...":"野生的拉鲁拉丝出现了！满充的蛇纹熊勇敢地战斗着……","Wally threw the Poké Ball! ...One, two, three... Gotcha!":"满充扔出了精灵球！……一、二、三……抓到了！","Wally caught Ralts!":"满充抓到了拉鲁拉丝！","I did it! A Pokémon of my very own! Thank you for coming with me, {player}.":"我做到了！我自己的宝可梦！谢谢你陪我来，{player}。","I will take Zigzagoon back to Norman. Maybe someday Ralts and I can battle you!":"我要把蛇纹熊还给千里先生。也许有一天，我和拉鲁拉丝能和你对战！","Wally looked so happy with his Ralts. Thank you, {player}.":"满充和他的拉鲁拉丝看起来好开心。谢谢你，{player}。","Rustboro City is north of here, past Route 104 and Petalburg Woods. Its Leader, Roxanne, is a fine first challenge in Hoenn.":"从这里往北，经过104号道路和橙华森林就是卡那兹市。那里的馆主杜娟很适合当你在丰缘的第一个挑战。","Come back when you hold four badges. Then we will see what a Champion can do.":"等你有了四枚徽章再来吧。到时候就让我看看冠军的实力。","Wally caught a Pokémon with your help? Thank you! He has not smiled like that in a long time.":"满充在你的帮助下抓到宝可梦了？谢谢你！他已经很久没有笑得这么开心了。","My son Wally has always been sickly. He is leaving for Verdanturf Town soon, where the air is clean.":"我儿子满充一直体弱多病。他很快就要搬去空气干净的绿荫镇了。","I do hope he finds a friend to keep him company there.":"真希望他在那里能找到一个陪伴他的朋友。","Hey, a new face! You have to battle me if our eyes meet. Those are the rules!":"嘿，生面孔！只要视线对上了就得对战。这是规矩！","Aww, I lost!":"啊，输了！","If you get stronger, will you battle me again sometime?":"等你变得更强了，还会再和我对战吗？","My Wurmple are going to grow up into something amazing. Want to see them now?":"我的刺尾虫会长成很厉害的宝可梦。要现在看看吗？","They will be amazing someday, I promise!":"总有一天它们会很厉害的，我保证！","A Wurmple can evolve into two different Pokémon. Nobody knows which one until it happens!":"刺尾虫可以进化成两种不同的宝可梦。不到进化的那一刻，谁也不知道会是哪一种！","Tiana":"缇娜","I caught these two all by myself! Let me show you how strong they are!":"这两只都是我自己抓的！让你看看它们有多强！","You are really good...":"你真厉害……","Shroomish spreads spores. If they touch your Pokémon, it might get poisoned or fall asleep!":"蘑蘑菇会散播孢子。碰到的话，你的宝可梦可能会中毒或睡着！","I just started my journey too! Let us both do our best... by battling!":"我也才刚开始旅行！我们一起加油吧……用对战的方式！","Wow, you are strong!":"哇，你好强！","I am going back to Oldale to heal my Pokémon. See you!":"我要回古辰镇治疗宝可梦了。再见！","Ah, a new Trainer! Norman, our Gym Leader, asks that every new Trainer drop by the Gym first. It is just up the road.":"啊，新来的训练家！我们的道馆馆主千里先生说，新来的训练家都要先去道馆一趟。道馆就在路的那头。","Norman is really strong. Even Trainers with lots of badges lose to him!":"千里先生真的很强。就连有很多徽章的训练家也会输给他！","West of town, Route 104 runs along the beach and up into Petalburg Woods. Rustboro City is on the other side.":"城镇西边的104号道路沿着海滩一直通到橙华森林。卡那兹市就在森林另一边。","Pokémon from far away often will not obey a Trainer with too few badges. Hoenn's Gyms fix that, one badge at a time!":"从远方来的宝可梦，常常不听徽章太少的训练家的话。丰缘的道馆会一枚一枚地帮你解决！","X items raise a stat for the rest of a battle. Very handy against a tough Gym Leader!":"能力强化道具能在整场对战中提高一项能力。对付难缠的道馆馆主很有用！","They say Norman came to Petalburg from far away, a bit like you. Now nobody here can imagine the town without him.":"听说千里先生也是从远方搬来橙华市的，有点像你。现在这里的人都想象不出没有他的橙华市了。","Some Pokémon only come out when you Surf on the water. The pond in town has a few!":"有些宝可梦只有冲浪时才会出现。镇上的池塘里就有几只！","Route 102. West: Petalburg City. East: Oldale Town.":"102号道路。西：橙华市。东：古辰镇。","Trainer tips: a Pokémon that is badly hurt is easier to catch. Weaken it first, then throw!":"训练家小提示：伤得越重的宝可梦越容易抓。先削弱它，再扔球！","Petalburg City. Where people live in harmony with the green of nature.":"橙华市。人们与大自然的绿意和谐共处的城市。","Petalburg City Pokémon Gym. Leader: Norman, a father who knows what real strength is.":"橙华市宝可梦道馆。馆主：千里，懂得何谓真正强大的父亲。","Wally writes to me from Verdanturf. He says he grows stronger every day. I think you had something to do with that.":"满充从绿荫镇给我写信了。他说自己一天比一天强壮。我想这和你脱不了关系。","Yo, Champion! Norman uses Normal-type Pokémon. Fighting moves hit them hard, and his Normal moves cannot touch a Ghost type!":"嘿，冠军！千里用的是一般属性的宝可梦。格斗属性招式对它们效果拔群，而它们的一般属性招式打不中幽灵属性！","Watch out for his Slaking. It hits like a falling boulder... but it is so lazy that it only attacks every other turn.":"小心他的请假王。它的攻击像落石一样猛……不过它懒得只会隔一回合才攻击一次。","This is the Balance Badge. You earned it in a battle I will not soon forget.":"这是平衡徽章。你在一场让我难忘的对战中赢得了它。","{player} received the Balance Badge from Norman!":"{player}从千里那里得到了平衡徽章！","With five Hoenn badges, Pokémon up to level 50 will obey you, wherever they come from.":"有了五枚丰缘徽章，50级以下的宝可梦都会听你的话，不管它们来自哪里。","And take this: TM42, Facade. If your Pokémon is burned, poisoned or paralyzed, it hits twice as hard.":"还有这个：招式学习器42，硬撑。如果你的宝可梦处于灼伤、中毒或麻痹状态，威力会变成两倍。","East of Mauville, Route 118 crosses the sea. If one of your Pokémon knows Surf, the road beyond is yours.":"紫堇市东边的118号道路要渡海。只要你有宝可梦会冲浪，前面的路就任你走了。","Norman taught me that speed decides most battles. Let me show you!":"千里教会我，速度决定大多数对战的胜负。让我证明给你看！","Norman is strong, and he is fair. Losing to him always teaches you something.":"千里很强，也很公正。输给他总能学到些什么。","Every Pokémon in this Gym is a Normal type. Normal does not mean weak!":"这座道馆里的宝可梦全是一般属性。一般可不代表弱！","Hmm, not bad at all.":"嗯，还真不赖。","Normal types can learn moves of many other types. Never assume you know what is coming!":"一般属性能学会许多其他属性的招式。千万别以为你猜得到对手会出什么！","George":"乔治","My Slakoth looks lazy, but just wait until it gets going!":"我的懒人獭看起来懒洋洋的，等它动起来你就知道厉害了！","Still yawning...":"还在打哈欠……","Slakoth sleeps most of the day. Its evolution, Vigoroth, cannot keep still at all!":"懒人獭一天到晚都在睡觉。它进化后的过动猿却一刻也静不下来！","So you hold four badges now. Then I will battle you, not as the man who welcomed you to Hoenn, but as a Gym Leader. Show me everything you have!":"你已经有四枚徽章了啊。那我就不以迎接你来丰缘的人，而是以道馆馆主的身份和你对战。把你的全部实力都拿出来吧！","...I lost. You have grown even stronger since you came to Hoenn. I am proud to have battled you.":"……我输了。你来到丰缘之后变得更强了。能和你对战，我很自豪。","So you picked my door. Bad luck for you!":"原来你选了我这扇门。真是倒霉啊！","Nobody gets through this room without a battle!":"谁都别想不战斗就通过这个房间！","The pike is long, and your Pokémon look tired already.":"水管还很长，你的宝可梦看起来已经累了。","I have been waiting in this room for ages. Let us battle!":"我在这个房间里等了好久。来对战吧！","Go on, then. The next door awaits.":"去吧。下一扇门在等着你。","Your luck held this time...":"这次你的运气不错……","I hope the next room is kinder to you.":"希望下一个房间对你好一点。","...So you made it this far. I am Lucy, the Pike Queen. Luck brought you here. Let us see if it carries you past me.":"……你居然走到了这里。我是水管皇后小蓟。是运气把你带到这里的。看看它能不能让你越过我吧。","...You again. This time, luck will not be enough.":"……又是你。这次光靠运气可不够。","...Your luck is real. Take it.":"……你的运气是真的。收下吧。","...I see. It was never only luck with you.":"……原来如此。你靠的从来不只是运气。","Do not mind me. I am only resting my feet.":"别管我。我只是在歇歇脚。","I took the wrong door three times in a row. Good luck to you!":"我连续选错了三次门。祝你好运！","This pike goes on and on... Which way was out again?":"这水管怎么走都走不完……出口在哪边来着？","A strong Trainer blocks the way!":"一位很强的训练家挡住了去路！","Your Pokémon were all restored to full health!":"你的宝可梦全都完全恢复了！","Two Trainers are waiting together!":"两位训练家一起在等着！","The Pike Queen has come to battle you herself!":"水管皇后亲自前来和你对战了！","Lucy recognizes your luck. You earned the Silver Luck Symbol!":"小蓟认可了你的运气。你得到了银色运气象征！","Lucy recognizes your luck. You earned the Gold Luck Symbol!":"小蓟认可了你的运气。你得到了金色运气象征！","The room is full of tall grass... Something is moving in it!":"房间里长满了高高的草……里面有东西在动！","A {mon} jumped out and attacked!":"{mon}突然跳了出来发动攻击！","A nurse is waiting here to look after your Pokémon.":"这里有位护士在等着照顾你的宝可梦。","{mon} was restored to full health!":"{mon}完全恢复了！","Left door":"左边的门","Middle door":"中间的门","Right door":"右边的门","That door... I sense someone waiting behind it.":"那扇门……我感觉后面有人在等着。","That door... it fills me with a strange nostalgia.":"那扇门……让我有种奇怪的怀念感。","That door... I can hear whispering behind it.":"那扇门……我听到后面有人在小声说话。","That door... there is a scent of Pokémon behind it.":"那扇门……后面有宝可梦的气味。","All three doors... something terrible waits behind every one of them.":"三扇门……每一扇后面都有可怕的东西在等着。","Welcome to the Battle Pike! Choose your way through fourteen rooms.":"欢迎来到对战水管！请选择你的路线，穿过 14 个房间。","Enter three Pokémon. In every other room you pick one of three doors. Behind it may be a battle, a wild Pokémon, a nurse... or something worse.":"请报名 3 只宝可梦。每隔一个房间，你要从三扇门里选一扇。门后可能是对战、野生宝可梦、护士……也可能是更糟的事。","Your Pokémon are not healed between rooms: only a healing room will help them. If all three faint, your challenge is over.":"房间之间宝可梦不会回复，只有回复房间能帮上忙。3 只都倒下的话，挑战就结束了。","Get through all fourteen rooms to finish a pass and earn Battle Points. Pokémon above level 50 battle at level 50, and items from the Bag cannot be used.":"穿过全部 14 个房间就算走完一趟，可以获得对战点数。超过 50 级的宝可梦按 50 级对战，不能使用背包里的道具。","Passes in a row: {n}. Your best: {best}.":"连续走完的趟数：{n}。最佳纪录：{best}。","Good luck in the Pike!":"祝你在水管里好运！","Room {n} of 14.":"第 {n} 个房间（共 14 个）。","Which door will you take?":"要走哪扇门？","You retired from the Pike.":"你退出了水管。","All your Pokémon fainted. Your challenge is over. Please try again!":"你的宝可梦全都倒下了。挑战结束。请再接再厉！","Congratulations! You made it through the Pike!":"恭喜！你走完了水管！","Choose a door, and good luck.":"请选一扇门，祝你好运。","Listen to the maid. Her hint is about one door, and the other two will never be the same kind of room.":"好好听女仆的话。她的提示只说一扇门，另外两扇门绝不会是同一类房间。","If your Pokémon are worn out, a door with a strange nostalgia or with someone waiting behind it may hold a nurse.":"如果你的宝可梦累坏了，让人怀念的门、或是后面有人在等的门，说不定会有护士。","They say the Pike Queen waits at the end of the second pass for a Trainer whose luck holds.":"听说对于运气一直不错的训练家，水管皇后会在第二趟的终点等着。","I will keep looking for rare stones here. If you find one on your travels, show me, {player}!":"我会继续在这里寻找稀有的石头。如果你在旅途中找到了，记得给我看看，{player}！","{player}! So the new Champion of Hoenn found my hiding place.":"{player}！原来是丰缘的新冠军找到了我的藏身之处。","I come to Meteor Falls to look for stones that fell from the sky. Every one of them has a story, like the meteorite Team Magma took.":"我来流星瀑布寻找从天上掉下来的石头。每一块都有自己的故事，就像被熔岩队拿走的那块陨石一样。","Wallace told me how you battled him. I have wanted to see it for myself ever since we met in Granite Cave. Show me, {player}!":"米可利跟我说了你和他对战的样子。自从我们在石之洞窟见面以后，我就一直想亲眼看看。让我见识一下吧，{player}！","...Magnificent. I knew you were strong, but this... You truly are the Champion of Hoenn.":"……太精彩了。我知道你很强，但没想到这么强……你真不愧是丰缘的冠军。","I left something for you at my house in Mossdeep: a Pokémon I met on my travels. I think it would be happy with a Trainer like you.":"我在绿岭市的家里给你留了点东西：一只我在旅途中遇到的宝可梦。我想它跟着你这样的训练家会很幸福。","Gilbert":"吉尔伯特","The currents here are a free ride west! Going east is the hard part. Let us battle!":"这里的激流能免费把你带往西边！往东走才难呢。来对战吧！","I got carried away...":"我被冲走了……","Stay in the calm water between the currents if you want to swim east.":"想往东游的话，就待在激流之间平静的水面上吧。","I swim against the current every morning. A battle will be easy after that!":"我每天早上都逆着激流游泳。比起那个，对战轻松多了！","Swept away, for once...":"难得被冲走了一次……","The currents all flow toward Slateport. Pacifidlog is the hard way.":"所有的激流都流向凯那市。去暮水镇才是难的那条路。","Lisa & Ray":"莉莎和雷","My little brother and I never lose in the water! Two against two!":"我和弟弟在水里从来没输过！二对二！","We lost... even in the water.":"我们输了……连在水里都输了。","Next time we will train in the currents. Then we will win!":"下次我们要在激流里训练。那样就能赢了！","Out here, the big ones bite. Like you!":"在这里上钩的都是大家伙。比如你！","The currents bring the fish right to this islet. I never have to move.":"激流会把鱼直接带到这座小岛来。我根本不用挪地方。","Slateport is right there, but you will not get past me!":"凯那市就在前面了，不过你别想从我这里过去！","You swim like a Kingdra...":"你游得像刺龙王一样……","Slateport's beach is just west. The currents make the trip from Pacifidlog so fast!":"凯那市的海滩就在西边。有激流的话，从暮水镇过来快得很！","I train where the currents meet the open sea. Ready?":"我在激流和大海交汇的地方修行。准备好了吗？","Pulled under...":"被拖到水底了……","Some say a Pokémon as old as the sea itself sleeps somewhere around here.":"听说这附近沉睡着一只和大海一样古老的宝可梦。","It is dark in here, but I saw you coming!":"这里很暗，不过我早就看到你过来了！","You will not reach the top past me!":"有我在，你别想到达顶端！","One Pokémon is all I need for you.":"对付你，一只宝可梦就够了。","Lost in the dark? Then let us battle!":"在黑暗里迷路了？那就来对战吧！","Beaten in the dark...":"在黑暗中输掉了……","Go on, the top is still far.":"去吧，离顶端还远着呢。","Your Pokémon see better than mine in here.":"在这里，你的宝可梦比我的看得更清楚。","Your Battle Bag holds ten kinds of items at most. Left behind: {items}.":"对战包包最多只能放 10 种道具。舍弃了：{items}。","Welcome to the Battle Pyramid! Climb seven dark floors to reach the top.":"欢迎来到对战金字塔！爬过 7 层黑暗的楼层，就能到达顶端。","Enter three Pokémon. Inside, your own Bag stays here: you get the Battle Bag, and whatever you find goes into it and stays there for next time.":"请登记 3 只宝可梦。你自己的背包要留在这里：里面用的是对战包包，捡到的东西都会放进去，下次挑战还在。","Pokémon above level 50 battle at level 50, and held items stay with your own Pokémon. You cannot save inside.":"超过 50 级的宝可梦会以 50 级参加对战，携带的道具会留在你自己的宝可梦身上。里面不能存档。","Rounds in a row: {n}. Your best: {best}.":"连续登顶的轮数：{n}。最佳纪录：{best}。","Here is your Battle Bag. Good luck in the dark!":"这是你的对战包包。祝你在黑暗中好运！","Floor {n} cleared.":"第 {n} 层通过了。","Floor {n} is next. Will you keep climbing?":"接下来是第 {n} 层。要继续往上爬吗？","Keep climbing":"继续往上","You retired from the Pyramid.":"你退出了金字塔。","Floor {n}. It is pitch-dark...":"第 {n} 层。伸手不见五指……","Ha! You made it to the top! I am Brandon, the Pyramid King. You climbed in the dark; now show me your courage in the light!":"哈！你爬到顶端了！我是金字塔法老神代。你在黑暗中爬了上来，现在就在光明下让我看看你的勇气吧！","Back at the top again! Then the time for holding back is over!":"又爬到顶端来了！那我也不必再手下留情了！","What courage! You have earned this.":"好勇气！这是你应得的。","Splendid! Nobody has climbed like you.":"太精彩了！从没有人像你这样爬上来过。","The Pyramid King is waiting at the top!":"金字塔法老在顶端等着你！","Brandon recognizes your courage. You earned the Silver Brave Symbol!":"神代认可了你的勇气。你得到了银色勇气象征！","Brandon recognizes your courage. You earned the Gold Brave Symbol!":"神代认可了你的勇气。你得到了金色勇气象征！","Congratulations! You reached the top of the Pyramid!":"恭喜！你到达了金字塔的顶端！","All your Pokémon fainted in the dark. Your challenge is over.":"你的宝可梦在黑暗中全部倒下了。挑战结束。","On this floor there are still {t} Trainers and {i} items. The ladder up is somewhere in the dark...":"这一层还有 {t} 个训练家和 {i} 个道具。往上的梯子就在黑暗中的某个地方……","Every win lights up the dark a little. Beat the Trainers and you will see the way up more easily.":"每赢一场，黑暗就会亮一点。打败训练家，就更容易找到往上的路。","Talk to a Trainer you have beaten: they will tell you how many Trainers and items are left on that floor.":"跟打败过的训练家说话，他们会告诉你这一层还剩几个训练家和道具。","They say the Pyramid King waits at the very top for Trainers who climb three times in a row.":"听说连续爬到顶端 3 次的训练家，会在最顶上遇到金字塔法老。","The ladder leads up into the dark.":"梯子通往上方的黑暗。","In there, your Pokémon heal only with the items you find, and with a short rest on each landing between floors. Every battle you win lets you see a little farther in the dark.":"在里面，宝可梦只能靠捡到的道具回复，另外每层之间的平台上可以稍作休息。每赢一场对战，在黑暗中就能看得更远一点。","You rest on the landing. Your Pokémon get their PP back, and any that fainted get up with half their HP.":"你在平台上休息了一下。宝可梦的 PP 都回复了，倒下的宝可梦也恢复了一半 HP。","Brandon restored your Pokémon to full health.":"神代让你的宝可梦完全恢复了。","Fortune-teller":"占卜师","Let me read what waits for you in the Pyramid...":"让我来看看金字塔里有什么在等着你……","Believe it or not, as you like. The dark keeps its own secrets.":"信不信由你。黑暗自有它的秘密。","A tingling, a crackle... The wild Pokémon ahead will try to leave yours unable to move. Paralysis!":"一阵酥麻，一阵噼啪……前面的野生宝可梦会想让你的宝可梦动弹不得。是麻痹！","A sickly purple haze... The wild Pokémon ahead carry poison. Beware!":"一片令人作呕的紫色烟雾……前面的野生宝可梦带着毒。要小心！","Flames, so many flames... The wild Pokémon ahead will try to burn yours.":"火焰，好多火焰……前面的野生宝可梦会想灼伤你的宝可梦。","I see moves running dry... The wild Pokémon ahead love to drain your moves of their PP.":"我看到招式一点一点用尽……前面的野生宝可梦最爱耗光你招式的 PP。","Something floating, never touching the ground... The wild Pokémon ahead do not fear {type}-type moves.":"有什么飘浮着，从不着地……前面的野生宝可梦不怕{type}属性的招式。","A trap that will not let go... Some wild Pokémon ahead will not let yours run away.":"一个不会松开的陷阱……前面有些野生宝可梦不会让你的宝可梦逃走。","A bitter chill... The wild Pokémon ahead bring the cold, and may freeze yours solid.":"一股刺骨的寒意……前面的野生宝可梦带来寒冷，可能会把你的宝可梦冻住。","A flash, a roar... Some wild Pokémon ahead would rather blow themselves up than lose.":"一道闪光，一声巨响……前面有些野生宝可梦宁可自爆也不愿认输。","A mind reaching into yours... The wild Pokémon ahead wield psychic power.":"有一股意念伸进你的脑海……前面的野生宝可梦拥有超能力。","Hard, heavy stone... {type}-type Pokémon wait in the dark ahead.":"坚硬又沉重的石头……{type}属性的宝可梦在前方的黑暗中等着。","Fists and fury... {type}-type Pokémon wait in the dark ahead.":"拳头与怒火……{type}属性的宝可梦在前方的黑暗中等着。","Rain, sun, sand, hail... The wild Pokémon ahead will change the weather to suit themselves.":"雨、阳光、沙尘、冰雹……前面的野生宝可梦会把天气变成对自己有利。","A buzzing, a skittering... {type}-type Pokémon wait in the dark ahead.":"嗡嗡声，窸窣声……{type}属性的宝可梦在前方的黑暗中等着。","A shadow within the shadows... {type}-type Pokémon wait ahead.":"影子里的影子……{type}属性的宝可梦在前方等着。","The sound of waves, deep in the desert... {type}-type Pokémon wait ahead.":"沙漠深处竟有海浪声……{type}属性的宝可梦在前方等着。","Cold breath on your neck... {type}-type Pokémon haunt the dark ahead.":"脖子后面一阵冷气……{type}属性的宝可梦在前方的黑暗中徘徊。","The gleam of metal... {type}-type Pokémon wait ahead.":"金属的光泽……{type}属性的宝可梦在前方等着。","Wings, and scales... {a}- and {b}-type Pokémon wait ahead.":"翅膀，还有鳞片……{a}属性和{b}属性的宝可梦在前方等着。","I see stones that changed the ones who touched them... The wild Pokémon ahead evolved by a stone.":"我看到改变了触碰者的石头……前面的野生宝可梦都是靠石头进化的。","Nothing strange at all... Plain {type}-type Pokémon wait ahead. Do not let your guard down!":"没什么特别的……前面只是普通的{type}属性宝可梦。可别大意！","Raised dots are carved into the wall: {braille}":"墙上刻着凸起的点：{braille}","Nothing stirs. The wall feels lifeless, as if something far away still holds it shut.":"什么都没有发生。墙壁毫无动静，好像远方还有什么东西把它封住了。","With a deep rumble, the wall at the back of the room slides aside!":"伴随着低沉的轰隆声，房间深处的墙壁移开了！","Let Wailord lead the way, and let Relicanth follow at the very end.":"让吼鲸王走在最前面，让古空棘鱼跟在最后面。","The whole chamber trembles! Far away, something heavy groans and shifts...":"整个石室都在震动！远方有什么沉重的东西发出声响，移动了……","It sounded like three great doors opening, somewhere across Hoenn.":"听起来像是丰缘某处有三扇巨大的门打开了。","Lights flicker across the ancient body. The Pokémon stirs and rises!":"古老的身体上闪起了点点光芒。宝可梦动了起来，站起身来！","All three ancient Pokémon are awake. A deep silence settles over the old ruins of Hoenn.":"三只古代宝可梦都已经醒来。丰缘的古老遗迹重归寂静。","Walk once all the way around the edge of this room.":"沿着这个房间的边缘走一整圈。","From here, two steps right and two steps down. Then show your Strength.":"从这里往右走两步，再往下走两步。然后展现你的怪力。","Let a light shine in the very middle of this room.":"在这个房间的正中央，让光芒闪耀。","Dig here.":"在此挖掘。","Long ago our people lived here by the sea, side by side with Pokémon.":"很久以前，我们的族人住在这片海边，与宝可梦一同生活。","We feared the power of three great Pokémon, so we shut them away in three far places.":"我们畏惧三只伟大宝可梦的力量，于是把它们封印在三个遥远的地方。","Rock, ice and steel: the three sleep until the giants of the sea call them.":"岩石、冰与钢铁：三者将一直沉睡，直到大海的巨物呼唤它们。","The key to every door lies under the sea.":"打开每一扇门的关键，就在海底。","Here, in the sand, sleeps the one made of rock.":"在这片沙中，沉睡着岩石之躯者。","Here, by the sea, sleeps the one made of ice.":"在这片海边，沉睡着寒冰之躯者。","Here, in the tomb, sleeps the one made of steel.":"在这座墓穴中，沉睡着钢铁之躯者。","Did you feel that rumble? The walls with the dots... something behind them is awake now!":"你感觉到刚才的震动了吗？那些刻着点的墙壁……后面有什么东西醒过来了！","Ruins with dotted writing hide all over Hoenn: in this cave, in the desert north of Route 111, and in a tomb on Route 120.":"丰缘各地都藏着刻有点字的遗迹：这个洞穴、111号道路北边的沙漠，还有120号道路上的一座墓穴。","The dots are braille. I can read them, but the doors never open. They say the key sleeps in a chamber under the sea of Route 134.":"那些点是点字。我看得懂，可是门从来没打开过。听说关键沉睡在134号道路海底的一间石室里。","These ruins have woken up! Read the wall inside again: it tells you how to open the door.":"这座遗迹苏醒了！再去读一次里面的墙壁吧，上面写着开门的方法。","An old book says the three ruins answer to one chamber under the sea. Dive where the water turns deep on Route 134.":"一本古书上说，三座遗迹都听命于海底的一间石室。到134号道路水变深的地方潜下去吧。","Inside, they say, you need the two great Pokémon of the sea: Wailord and Relicanth.":"听说在里面，需要大海的两只大宝可梦：吼鲸王和古空棘鱼。","Imani":"伊玛妮","The sea between Petalburg and Dewford is my swimming pool. Race you to a battle!":"橙华市和武斗镇之间的大海就是我的游泳池。来比比谁先开始对战吧！","There is a little island to the south with a cave on it. Nobody I know has seen the back of it.":"南边有座小岛，岛上有个洞穴。我认识的人里，没人见过洞穴深处。","Dominik":"多米尼克","A Trainer out at sea! You will not get past without a battle.":"海上有训练家！不对战的话可别想过去。","Washed up...":"被冲上岸了……","Wailmer grows up into Wailord, the biggest Pokémon in the sea. Can you imagine riding one?":"吼吼鲸长大会变成吼鲸王，是海里最大的宝可梦。你能想象骑在它背上吗？","Beverly":"贝弗莉","My Pokémon and I swim here every day. Let us see how strong you are!":"我和我的宝可梦每天都在这里游泳。让我看看你有多强吧！","You were too strong for us...":"你对我们来说太强了……","Dewford is just east of here. Swim along Route 106 and you are there.":"武斗镇就在东边。沿着106号道路游过去就到了。","A doorway of carved stone is set into the rock. Rows of little dots run around its frame.":"岩石上嵌着一道雕刻过的石门。门框四周刻着一排排小点。","H-help! Somebody, help me!":"救、救命啊！谁来救救我！","You there! This Zigzagoon will not leave me alone! My bag, there on the ground: take a Poké Ball and send out the Pokémon in it!":"你！这只蛇纹熊一直缠着我！我的包就掉在地上：拿出一个精灵球，派出里面的宝可梦！","Which Pokémon will you send out?":"要派出哪只宝可梦？","Whew... You saved me! Thank you so much.":"呼……你救了我！太感谢了。","Whew... It ran off. Thank you for standing up to it!":"呼……它跑掉了。谢谢你挺身而出！","I am Professor Birch. And you must be {player}, the Trainer Professor Oak wrote to me about! Come to my lab: we can talk there.":"我是小田卷博士。你就是大木博士信里提到的训练家{player}吧！到我的研究所来，我们在那里聊。","Oh! You must be {player}! Dad told me all about you. I am {rival3}.":"哦！你就是{player}吧！爸爸跟我说过你的事了。我是{rival3}。","I am helping my dad keep track of Hoenn's Pokémon. You are the Champion from far away, right?":"我在帮爸爸记录丰缘的宝可梦。你就是那位从远方来的冠军，对吧？","Then let me see how you battle! My Pokémon and I will not go easy on you!":"那就让我看看你是怎么对战的！我和我的宝可梦可不会手下留情哦！","Wow... You really are strong! Now I see why Dad wanted your help.":"哇……你真的好强！我终于明白爸爸为什么想找你帮忙了。","I won? Your Pokémon from home did not want to listen, did they? Hoenn's badges will fix that!":"我赢了？你从家乡带来的宝可梦不太听话吧？拿到丰缘的徽章就好了！","Let's head back to the lab. Dad will want to hear about this!":"我们回研究所吧。爸爸一定很想知道！","Shh! Do not step there! I am sketching the footprints of a rare Pokémon.":"嘘！别踩那里！我正在描一只稀有宝可梦的脚印。","Route 102 and Petalburg City are that way, but you will have to wait until I am done. It may take a while...":"102号道路和橙华市在那边，不过你得等我画完。可能还要好一阵子……","Professor Birch says Hoenn has more water than land. Pokémon that swim must love it here!":"小田卷博士说丰缘的水比陆地还多。会游泳的宝可梦一定很喜欢这里！","The Pokémon Center heals your Pokémon for free. Pokémon Centers are the same in every region!":"宝可梦中心会免费治疗你的宝可梦。每个地区的宝可梦中心都一样！","Route 103 is north of here. Its pond is full of Pokémon, if you can cross the water.":"103号道路在这里的北边。如果能渡过水面，池塘里有好多宝可梦。","The PC here connects to the same storage system as the ones in Kanto and Johto. Handy, isn't it?":"这里的电脑和关都、城都的电脑连着同一个保管系统。很方便吧？","Potions and Poké Balls: that is all a new Trainer needs. Well, and a little courage!":"伤药和精灵球：新手训练家需要的就这些。嗯，再加上一点勇气！","Zigzagoon zigzag through the grass, picking things up as they go. Sometimes they bring back something nice!":"蛇纹熊会在草丛里歪歪扭扭地跑来跑去，一路捡东西。有时还会带回好东西呢！","Route 101. North: Oldale Town. South: Littleroot Town.":"101号道路。北：古辰镇。南：未白镇。","Oldale Town. A town where things begin, and where they come back to.":"古辰镇。一切从这里开始，也会回到这里。","Route 103. South: Oldale Town.":"103号道路。南：古辰镇。","My sketch is finished! The road west to Petalburg City is all yours. Mind the footprints!":"我的素描画好了！往西去橙华市的路随你走。小心别踩到脚印哦！","There are seven more Gyms in Hoenn. Each one will teach you something new, I am sure of it.":"丰缘还有七座道馆。我相信每一座都会教会你新的东西。","Devon Corporation. The doors are locked: visitors by appointment only.":"得文公司。大门锁着：访客须预约。","Hey, Champion! Welcome to Hoenn's first Gym. Roxanne uses Rock-type Pokémon.":"嘿，冠军！欢迎来到丰缘的第一座道馆。杜娟用的是岩石属性的宝可梦。","Water and Grass moves work great on them. Fire, Normal and Flying moves barely scratch them.":"水属性和草属性的招式对它们效果很好。火、一般和飞行属性的招式几乎伤不了它们。","Picked Torchic? Train it until it evolves: Combusken's Fighting moves crack rocks. A Shroomish from Petalburg Woods helps, too.":"选了火稚鸡？那就练到它进化吧：力壮鸡的格斗属性招式能击碎岩石。从橙华森林抓只蘑蘑菇也很有帮助。","And remember: above level 20, your Pokémon from home may not listen to you yet!":"还有别忘了：超过20级的话，你从家乡带来的宝可梦可能还不会听你的话！","A Quick Claw sometimes lets its holder move first. Let a slow Pokémon hold it!":"先制之爪有时能让携带它的宝可梦先出手。让慢吞吞的宝可梦带着吧！","Welcome to the Trainers' School! Here, everyone learns the basics of battling. Even a Champion can review them!":"欢迎来到训练家学校！大家在这里学习对战的基础。就算是冠军也可以来复习一下！","Please take this. Our best students get one.":"请收下这个。我们最优秀的学生都有一个。","This is the Stone Badge. You have earned it.":"这是原石徽章。这是你应得的。","{player} received the Stone Badge from Roxanne!":"{player}从杜娟那里得到了原石徽章！","With it, Pokémon up to level 25 will obey you here in Hoenn, even ones raised far away.":"有了它，在丰缘，25级以下的宝可梦都会听你的话，就算是在远方长大的也一样。","And please take this, too. TM39 is Rock Tomb: it drops boulders on the foe and slows it down.":"请也收下这个。招式学习器39是岩石封锁：让岩石砸向对手，还能降低对手的速度。","The Devon Corporation is the pride of Rustboro. Half the Poké Balls in Hoenn are made in that building!":"得文公司是卡那兹市的骄傲。丰缘一半的精灵球都是在那栋楼里做的！","Roxanne is the best student the Trainers' School ever had. Now she teaches there when she is not at the Gym!":"杜娟是训练家学校有史以来最优秀的学生。现在她不在道馆的时候，就在学校教课！","They are digging a tunnel east of town, out on Route 116. Nobody gets through until it is safe.":"他们正在城东的116号道路挖隧道。在安全之前谁都不能过去。","Roxanne's Rock types shrug off Normal and Fire moves. Water and Grass wash them away!":"杜娟的岩石属性宝可梦不怕一般和火属性的招式。水和草属性就能把它们冲垮！","Great Balls catch Pokémon more easily than Poké Balls. They make them right here in Rustboro!":"超级球比精灵球更容易抓到宝可梦。就是在卡那兹市这里做的！","I work at Devon. Someone tried to steal our research papers in Petalburg Woods! Thank goodness a Trainer stepped in.":"我在得文公司工作。有人想在橙华森林抢走我们的研究文件！幸好有一位训练家出手相救。","Today we learned about type matchups. Water beats Fire, Fire beats Grass, Grass beats Water. Easy!":"今天我们学了属性相克。水克火，火克草，草克水。很简单！","Did you know some Pokémon have abilities that help in battle? Gyarados scares the Pokémon in front of it!":"你知道吗？有些宝可梦拥有在对战中派得上用场的特性。暴鲤龙会吓唬面前的宝可梦！","You have to get past me before you see Roxanne. My Geodude is solid as a rock!":"想见杜娟，得先过我这一关。我的小拳石可是硬得像石头一样！","Crumbled...":"碎掉了……","Roxanne studied everything about Rock types. She is really smart.":"杜娟把岩石属性研究得透透的。她真的很聪明。","Rocks and mountains! That is what I love. Let me show you why!":"岩石和高山！这就是我的最爱。让你看看为什么！","Even a mountain can fall...":"就连高山也会倒下……","Roxanne is up ahead. Her Nosepass always points north, did you know?":"杜娟就在前面。你知道吗？她的朝北鼻永远指着北方。","Hello, I am Roxanne, the Leader of the Rustboro Gym. I became a Leader to put what I learned at school into practice. A Champion from Kanto? Then let me learn from you, too!":"你好，我是卡那兹道馆的馆主杜娟。我当上馆主，是为了把在学校学到的东西付诸实践。关都来的冠军？那就让我也向你学习吧！","So... I lost. It seems I still have a great deal to learn.":"原来……我输了。看来我要学的东西还有很多。","Rustboro City. A city of stone, where nature and science go hand in hand.":"卡那兹市。自然与科学携手并进的石之城。","Rustboro City Pokémon Gym. Leader: Roxanne, the top student who loves rocks.":"卡那兹市宝可梦道馆。馆主：杜娟，热爱岩石的优等生。","Devon Corporation. From Poké Balls to the newest gadgets: technology for Trainers.":"得文公司。从精灵球到最新的小工具：为训练家打造的科技。","The blackboard says: \"A sleeping or frozen Pokémon cannot move. A paralyzed one is slower, and may not move.\"":"黑板上写着：“睡着或冰冻的宝可梦无法行动。麻痹的宝可梦速度会变慢，有时无法行动。”","Sorry, the road east is closed while we move the tunnel machines. Come back a little later.":"抱歉，我们正在搬运挖隧道的机器，往东的路暂时封闭。请晚点再来。","That Team Aqua grunt ran east, toward Route 116 and the Rusturf Tunnel. Please, get our Devon Goods back!":"那个海洋队手下往东逃了，朝116号道路和石头隧道去了。请帮我们把得文货物抢回来！","East: Route 116 and the Rusturf Tunnel. North: Route 115, closed for now.":"东：116号道路和石头隧道。北：115号道路，目前封闭。","Out of my way! These Devon Goods belong to Team Aqua now!":"让开！这些得文货物现在是海洋队的了！","Stop! Thief! Somebody stop him!":"站住！小偷！快拦住他！","Oh, it is you, the Trainer from Petalburg Woods! That man stole the Devon Goods, the parts we were about to ship!":"啊，是你，在橙华森林帮过我的训练家！那个人偷走了得文货物，那是我们正准备寄出的零件！","He ran east, toward Route 116 and the Rusturf Tunnel. Please, get them back!":"他往东边的116号道路和石头隧道跑了。拜托你把东西抢回来！","What? You followed me all the way in here? This tunnel does not even go anywhere!":"什么？你居然一路追到这里来了？这条隧道根本哪儿都通不到啊！","Fine! You want the Goods and this noisy bird back? Then beat me!":"好啊！想要回货物和这只吵死人的鸟？那就打赢我！","Argh! Take your stupid parts. I am out of here!":"可恶！破零件还你就是了。我闪人了！","{player} got the {item} back!":"{player}夺回了{item}！","Peeko! There you are, my girl!":"Peeko！原来你在这里！","Peeko flew happily back to Mr. Briney.":"Peeko开心地飞回了哈奇老人身边。","Thank you, young one! I am Briney, an old sailor. If you ever need to cross the sea, come to my cottage on Route 104. My boat is yours!":"谢谢你，年轻人！我是哈奇，一个老水手。要是你想渡海，就来104号道路的小屋找我。我的船随你用！","Thanks to you, the Devon Goods are safe. Please take good care of them on the way to Slateport!":"多亏了你，得文货物平安无事。去凯那市的路上请好好保管！","You got the Devon Goods back! Thank you! Our president wants to thank you himself. His office is upstairs.":"你把得文货物抢回来了！谢谢你！我们总裁想亲自向你道谢。他的办公室在楼上。","You gave Steven my letter? Thank you. That boy is always off somewhere, looking at rocks.":"你把信交给大吾了？谢谢你。那孩子总是跑到哪里去看石头。","My son Steven is in Granite Cave, near Dewford Town. Mr. Briney's boat can take you across the sea.":"我儿子大吾在武斗镇附近的石之洞窟。哈奇老人的船可以载你渡海。","So you are the Trainer who saved our research in the woods, and then the Devon Goods! I am the president of the Devon Corporation. You have my thanks.":"原来你就是在森林里保住了我们的研究、又抢回得文货物的训练家！我是得文公司的总裁。真是太感谢你了。","May I ask two favours of you? First, this letter is for my son, Steven. He is in Dewford Town, exploring Granite Cave as usual.":"我能拜托你两件事吗？第一，这封信是给我儿子大吾的。他在武斗镇，又跑去石之洞窟探险了。","Second, the Devon Goods must reach the Oceanic Museum in Slateport City. Would you take them there for us?":"第二，得文货物必须送到凯那市的海洋博物馆。你能帮我们送过去吗？","Old Mr. Briney on Route 104 still has his boat. I am sure he would take you across the sea.":"104号道路的哈奇老人还有一艘船。他一定愿意载你渡海。","Devon President":"得文公司总裁","My Machop trains every single day. Want to see how strong it got?":"我的腕力每天都在锻炼。想看看它变得有多强吗？","Machop, we need more training!":"腕力，我们还得多练练！","Fighting types hit Normal and Rock types hard. Remember that!":"格斗属性对一般和岩石属性很有效。要记住哦！","I just finished class at the Trainers' School. Time to test what I learned!":"我刚在训练家学校下课。来试试我学到的东西吧！","I should have studied harder...":"我应该再用功一点的……","The teacher says a Trainer should always know which types their Pokémon are weak to.":"老师说，训练家一定要知道自己的宝可梦怕哪些属性。","Did you know Nincada lives underground? I dug this one up myself!":"你知道土居忍士住在地底下吗？这只是我亲手挖出来的！","Back into the ground...":"回地底下去吧……","They say when Nincada evolves, something strange happens. I cannot wait to see it!":"听说土居忍士进化的时候会发生奇怪的事。我等不及想看看了！","Peeko! My Peeko! A man in a striped shirt grabbed her and ran into that tunnel! Please, young one, help an old sailor!":"Peeko！我的Peeko！一个穿条纹衣服的人抓走了它，跑进那条隧道了！年轻人，求你帮帮我这个老水手！","Hold it! I am looking for a good rock to rest on. A battle will do too!":"站住！我在找块好石头歇歇脚。来场对战也不错！","Rocks rolled away...":"石头滚走了……","They have been digging this tunnel for ages. The rock past here is too hard for their machines.":"他们挖这条隧道挖了好久了。再往前的岩石太硬，机器都挖不动。","We are digging toward Verdanturf Town, but the rock is too hard. If only we had a Pokémon strong enough to smash it...":"我们正在往绿荫镇的方向挖，可是岩石太硬了。要是有宝可梦能把它敲碎就好了……","Welcome to the Devon Corporation. Our president's office is on the third floor.":"欢迎光临得文公司。总裁办公室在三楼。","Route 116. East: the Rusturf Tunnel. West: Rustboro City.":"116号道路。东：石头隧道。西：卡那兹市。","Kelsey":"凯尔西","There it is... the master of the sea, asleep at the bottom of the world. Kyogre.":"就在那里……海洋之主，沉睡在世界的最深处。盖欧卡。","Well, well. The kid who keeps turning up. You followed us all the way to the sea floor?":"哎呀呀，又是那个老是冒出来的小鬼。你居然一路追到海底来了？","When Kyogre wakes, the seas will rise and every Pokémon of the sea will have room to live. That is Team Aqua's dream, and you will not sink it!":"等盖欧卡醒来，海面就会上涨，所有海里的宝可梦都能有地方生活。这就是海洋队的梦想，我可不会让你把它弄沉！","Hah... You are tough, kid, I will give you that. But you are too late. The Blue Orb has been shining since we came down here.":"哈……小鬼，你确实很强，这点我承认。但你来得太迟了。从我们下到这里开始，靛蓝色宝珠就一直在发光。","Archie raises the Blue Orb. It glows with a deep blue light!":"水梧桐高高举起靛蓝色宝珠。宝珠发出了深蓝色的光芒！","The water of the pool heaves. The huge Pokémon opens its eyes!":"水池里的水翻涌起来。那只巨大的宝可梦睁开了眼睛！","Kyogre dived into the depths and disappeared!":"盖欧卡潜入深处，消失得无影无踪！","Where are you going? Kyogre! I am the one who woke you!":"你要去哪里？盖欧卡！是我把你唤醒的啊！","Boss! The people on the surface are calling! A storm came out of nowhere, and the rain will not stop!":"老大！海面上的人传来消息！突然来了一场暴风雨，雨一直下个不停！","Archie! Do you see what you have done? The rain up there is drowning the land!":"水梧桐！你看看你干了什么好事？上面的大雨快要把陆地淹没了！","Maxie... You are one to talk. You took the Red Orb into the mountain, did you not?":"赤焰松……你还好意思说我。你不也把朱红色宝珠带进山里去了吗？","...I did. Groudon woke in the heart of the mountain, and then it was gone, just like your Kyogre. Neither of them obeys an orb, it seems.":"……没错。固拉多在山的深处醒来，然后就和你的盖欧卡一样消失了。看来它们俩都不会听宝珠的话。","If the master of the land and the master of the sea meet... Team Aqua, Team Magma, to the surface! We have to find them!":"要是大地之主和海洋之主碰面的话……海洋队、熔岩队，全员回到海面！我们得找到它们！","Rain is pouring down from a sky as dark as night. Somewhere out at sea, Kyogre is awake.":"大雨从黑得像夜晚一样的天空倾泻而下。在大海的某处，盖欧卡已经醒了。","I train on this islet where nobody bothers me. Nobody but you, it seems!":"我在这个没人打扰的小岛上修行。看来除了你以外是没人了！","My fists hit nothing but sea spray...":"我的拳头只打中了浪花……","Have you noticed the darker water around here? That is where the sea is deepest.":"你注意到这附近颜色比较深的海水了吗？那里就是海最深的地方。","Camden":"卡姆登","The currents south of Mossdeep are the best workout there is!":"绿岭市南边的海流是最棒的锻炼！","I got swept off my rhythm...":"我被冲乱了节奏……","I saw a submarine heading south the other day. Strange thing to see out here.":"前几天我看到一艘潜水艇往南边开去了。在这种地方看到真奇怪。","Jonah":"约拿","Something big is biting today! Is it you?":"今天有大家伙上钩了！是你吗？","With a Super Rod you can hook real monsters out here.":"用厉害钓竿的话，在这里能钓到真正的大家伙。","Donna":"唐娜","Swimming this far from land? You must be good. Let us see!":"游到离陆地这么远的地方？你一定很厉害。让我看看吧！","I need to catch my breath...":"我得喘口气……","Route 128 is just south. The water there turns dark over something under the sea.":"128号道路就在南边。那里有片海水颜色很深，底下好像藏着什么。","This reef is my secret fishing spot. Now that you know, you have to battle me!":"这片礁石是我的秘密钓点。既然被你知道了，就得跟我对战！","Reeled in and beaten...":"被钓上来，还被打败了……","Some days the sea goes quiet, as if something huge were sleeping under it.":"有些日子大海会变得特别安静，就好像底下睡着什么巨大的东西。","Kat":"凯特","Dark water like this gives me the shivers. A battle will warm me up!":"这么深色的海水让我直发抖。来场对战暖暖身吧！","Brrr... I lost and I am still cold.":"呜……输了，而且还是好冷。","People say the dark water hides a way into a cave under the sea.":"听说那片深色的海水底下，藏着通往海底洞窟的路。","I swam all the way from Ever Grande City. Let us see if you can keep up!":"我从彩幽市一路游过来的。看看你跟不跟得上！","You leave a big wake...":"你掀起的浪花真大……","Ever Grande City is far to the east. The strongest Trainers in Hoenn gather there.":"彩幽市在很远的东边。丰缘最强的训练家都聚集在那里。","Huh? How did you get down here without a submarine? ...Never mind, the boss went on ahead. You are too late!":"嗯？你没有潜水艇是怎么下来的？……算了，老大已经先走了。你来得太迟了！","This cavern is Team Aqua's now! Turn around and swim home!":"这个洞窟现在是海洋队的了！快掉头游回家吧！","Sunk like a stone...":"像石头一样沉下去了……","The boss has the Blue Orb. Once he reaches the deepest chamber, it is all over.":"老大拿着靛蓝色宝珠。等他到了最深处的洞穴，一切就结束了。","You smashed your way through? Then I will smash you!":"你是把石头砸开过来的？那我就把你也砸扁！","How are you this strong?":"你怎么会这么强？","There is a boulder in the way down. Good luck moving it!":"往下走的路上有块大岩石挡着。祝你推得动！","Down here, nobody can hear you call for help!":"在这底下，就算你喊救命也没人听得见！","Nobody heard me lose either, I hope...":"希望也没人听见我输了……","Shelly is waiting up ahead. She is still angry about the Weather Institute.":"阿泉就在前面等着。她还在为天气研究所的事生气呢。","Ahaha! You again? You ruined my plans at the Weather Institute. Not this time: the boss is about to wake the master of the sea!":"啊哈哈！又是你？你在天气研究所坏了我的好事。这次可不会了：老大马上就要唤醒海洋之主了！","Ahaha... Beaten again. Go on, then. You will see what the boss is made of.":"啊哈哈……又输了。那你去吧。你会见识到老大的厉害的。","Go on. The boss is in the deepest chamber. Ahaha... I wonder what you will find there.":"去吧。老大就在最深处的洞穴里。啊哈哈……真想知道你会在那里看到什么。","A huge Pokémon lies still at the bottom of the pool. It seems to be asleep.":"一只巨大的宝可梦静静地躺在水池底部。它好像在睡觉。","A dark opening in the rock. Bubbles rise from inside it.":"岩石上有个黑漆漆的洞口。有气泡从里面冒出来。","Team Aqua's submarine is moored at the rock. Its hatch is open, and nobody is aboard.":"海洋队的潜水艇停靠在岩石边。舱门开着，里面一个人也没有。","{player}! You made it out of the cavern. I saw the sky turn black from Mossdeep and came as fast as I could.":"{player}！你从洞窟里出来了。我在绿岭市看到天空变黑，就尽快赶过来了。","Kyogre is not the only one awake. Groudon has risen too, and both of them are heading for Sootopolis City.":"醒来的不只是盖欧卡。固拉多也苏醒了，它们俩正朝着琉璃市前进。","Sootopolis lies inside a crater on Route 126, west of Route 127. By sea, the only way in is under the water: Dive in the deep water south of the crater and you will come up in the city's lake.":"琉璃市位于127号道路西边、126号道路上的一个火山口里。从海上进去的唯一办法就是走水下：在火山口南边的深水处潜水，就能从城市的湖里浮上来。","I will fly ahead. Hurry, {player}!":"我先飞过去。快点，{player}！","John & Jay":"约翰和杰伊","We have battled side by side for fifty years. Shall we show you how it is done?":"我们并肩对战已经五十年了。要不要让你见识一下？","Fifty years, and still learning.":"五十年了，还在学习呢。","A good partner covers your weaknesses. That goes for Pokémon too.":"好搭档能弥补你的弱点。宝可梦也是一样。","Ah, those are the parts from Devon? Splendid! I am the captain of this museum's research ship. Thank you for bringing them all this way.":"这就是得文公司的零件吗？太好了！我是这间博物馆研究船的船长。谢谢你一路送过来。","Hold it right there! Those Devon parts are coming with us. Team Aqua needs them more than some museum does!":"站住！那些得文公司的零件要跟我们走。海洋队可比什么博物馆更需要它们！","Huh? You again, the kid from the tunnel? Fine. This time we are two!":"嗯？又是你，隧道里那个小鬼？好啊。这次我们有两个人！","No way... Hey, your turn! Do not let this kid get away with it!":"怎么可能……喂，换你上！别让这小鬼得逞！","Enough. So you are the one who keeps getting in our way.":"够了。原来一直在妨碍我们的就是你。","I am Archie, the leader of Team Aqua. Every Pokémon, and every person, was born from the sea. We want to give it back the space it once had.":"我是海洋队的首领水梧桐。所有的宝可梦和人类，都诞生于大海。我们要把大海曾经拥有的空间还给它。","Keep your parts, then. But know this: nobody stands between Team Aqua and the sea. Let us go!":"零件就留给你们吧。不过记住：谁也别想挡在海洋队和大海之间。我们走！","{player} handed over the {item}.":"{player}交出了{item}。","What a scare! Thank you. With these parts, our submarine will reach the bottom of the sea. Team Aqua must never get their hands on it.":"真是吓死人了！谢谢你。有了这些零件，我们的潜水艇就能到达海底了。绝不能让海洋队得到它。","If you are heading north, Route 110 leads to Mauville City. Its Gym Leader, Wattson, is a cheerful old man who loves electricity.":"要往北走的话，110号道路通往紫堇市。那里的道馆馆主铁旋是个热爱电力的开朗老爷爷。","{player}! I heard you got the Devon Goods to Slateport. Dad told me everything!":"{player}！听说你把得文货物送到凯那市了。爸爸都跟我说了！","My Pokémon and I have grown a lot since Route 103. Let's see whose team is stronger now!":"从103号道路到现在，我和我的宝可梦都成长了很多。来看看现在谁的队伍更强吧！","Wow... You are still way ahead of me. But I am catching up, just you wait!":"哇……你还是比我强好多。不过我会追上你的，等着瞧吧！","Yes! I won! Your Pokémon from home still will not listen, will they?":"太好了！我赢了！你从家乡带来的宝可梦还是不听话吧？","Mauville City is just up ahead. Good luck with Wattson. See you around!":"紫堇市就在前面了。祝你挑战铁旋顺利。再见！","Thanks to you, our submarine will soon explore the deepest sea. Team Aqua will not get near it, I promise you that.":"多亏了你，我们的潜水艇很快就能探索最深的海底了。我保证不会让海洋队靠近它。","I am waiting for some important parts from the Devon Corporation. Without them, our submarine cannot dive.":"我在等得文公司送来的重要零件。没有它们，我们的潜水艇就没办法下潜。","Ships from all over the world dock in Slateport. You can smell the sea in every street!":"世界各地的船都会停靠凯那市。每条街上都闻得到大海的味道！","The captain of the Oceanic Museum is building a submarine to explore the bottom of the sea. Imagine what lives down there!":"海洋博物馆的船长正在造一艘潜水艇，要去探索海底。真想知道那下面住着什么！","Route 110 is north of town. Follow it and you will reach Mauville City, the biggest city in Hoenn.":"城北就是110号道路。顺着走就能到达丰缘最大的城市紫堇市。","Some people wear blue bandanas around town lately. They say they want to give the land back to the sea. Strange...":"最近镇上有些人戴着蓝色头巾。听说他们想把陆地还给大海。真奇怪……","Super Potions heal more than Potions. Worth every coin before a big battle!":"好伤药比伤药回复得多。大战之前花这个钱很值得！","This is the museum's shipyard. We are building a submarine here! The captain is at the Oceanic Museum today.":"这里是博物馆的造船厂。我们在这里造潜水艇！船长今天在海洋博物馆。","With the parts from Devon, our submarine will be able to dive deeper than any before it.":"有了得文公司的零件，我们的潜水艇就能潜得比以往任何潜水艇都深。","The sea gives us everything: fish, salt, the wind for our ships. I could never live anywhere else.":"大海给了我们一切：鱼、盐，还有吹动船帆的风。我在别的地方可活不下去。","Welcome to the Oceanic Museum! The exhibits on the second floor are about the sea and the Pokémon that live in it.":"欢迎来到海洋博物馆！二楼的展览介绍大海和生活在海里的宝可梦。","The boss told us to wait here. ...What? I am just looking at the exhibits!":"老大叫我们在这里等着。……干嘛？我只是在看展览啦！","Hey, quit staring. Go and look at the fish or something.":"喂，别盯着看了。去看你的鱼吧。","Isabel":"伊莎贝尔","Plusle and Minun always cheer each other on. Watch them work together!":"正电拍拍和负电拍拍总是互相加油。看它们联手吧！","Even with all that cheering...":"就算那么努力加油……","When Plusle and Minun fight side by side, they make each other stronger. One on one, not so much.":"正电拍拍和负电拍拍并肩作战时会互相增强。一对一的话就没那么厉害了。","Edward":"爱德华","I saw you coming in my mind. I also saw myself winning!":"我在脑海中看到你来了。也看到了我赢的样子！","Abra teleports away when it senses danger. Catching one takes quick thinking.":"凯西一感觉到危险就会瞬间移动逃走。想抓到它得反应很快才行。","Dale":"戴尔","This pond has the best fish this side of Slateport. Here, meet my catch!":"这个池塘的鱼是凯那市这一带最棒的。来看看我钓到的！","Washed away...":"被冲走了……","Wailmer can blow water out of its nostrils. It is bigger than it looks, too!":"吼吼鲸会从鼻孔喷水。而且它比看起来还要大！","Mauville is just up the road! But you are not getting past me without a battle!":"紫堇市就在前面！不过不跟我对战，你别想过去！","Zapped...":"被电晕了……","Wattson's Gym is full of Electric types. Something that can block electricity would help!":"铁旋的道馆全是电属性的宝可梦。要是有能挡住电的宝可梦就好了！","Slateport City. The port where people and the sea meet.":"凯那市。人与大海相遇的港口。","The Oceanic Museum. Learn all about the wonders of the sea!":"海洋博物馆。来认识大海的奇妙吧！","A model of the deep sea floor. It is so dark down there that some Pokémon make their own light.":"深海海底的模型。那里暗得连一些宝可梦都会自己发光。","A model of a sea current. Currents carry warm water from the south seas all the way to Hoenn.":"洋流的模型。洋流把南方海域的温暖海水一路带到丰缘。","A model of a submarine. Below it, a note: \"Built in Slateport. Diving soon.\"":"潜水艇的模型。下面有张纸条：“凯那市制造。即将下潜。”","A model of a sea basin. Long ago, they say, the seas of Hoenn were wider than they are today.":"海盆的模型。据说很久以前，丰缘的海比现在还要宽广。","Fossils of ancient sea Pokémon. Some lived millions of years ago.":"古代海洋宝可梦的化石。有些生活在几百万年前。","Route 110. North: Mauville City. South: Slateport City.":"110号道路。北：紫堇市。南：凯那市。","Route 110. North: Mauville City.":"110号道路。北：紫堇市。","Black clouds hang over the crater. In the middle of the city, two enormous Pokémon face each other!":"乌云笼罩着火山口。在城市中央，两只巨大的宝可梦正互相对峙！","Groudon, the master of the land, and Kyogre, the master of the sea. Rain and scorching sun battle over Sootopolis.":"大地之主固拉多，与海洋之主盖欧卡。暴雨与烈日在琉璃市上空交替肆虐。","A roar splits the clouds. Rayquaza swoops down over the crater!":"一声咆哮撕裂了云层。烈空坐朝着火山口俯冲而下！","Rayquaza roars again. Groudon and Kyogre fall still, and the fury goes out of them.":"烈空坐再次咆哮。固拉多和盖欧卡停了下来，怒气也随之消散。","Kyogre sank back into the sea, Groudon went back into the earth, and Rayquaza flew off into the sky. The clouds over Sootopolis break apart.":"盖欧卡沉回了大海，固拉多回到了大地深处，烈空坐也飞向了天空。琉璃市上空的乌云散开了。","It is over. You woke Rayquaza and brought it here, {player}. Hoenn owes you its skies and its seas.":"结束了。是你唤醒了烈空坐，把它带到了这里，{player}。丰缘的天空与大海都要感谢你。","My teacher Juan is back in the Gym. Go and earn the last badge. Then come to Ever Grande City: I will be waiting there.":"我的老师亚当已经回到道馆了。去赢得最后一枚徽章吧。然后来彩幽市，我会在那里等你。","I knew you could do it. Thank you, {player}. I will be watching your journey to the League.":"我就知道你做得到。谢谢你，{player}。我会关注你前往联盟的旅程。","You must be {player}. Steven told me about you. I am Wallace. I used to lead this city's Gym.":"你就是{player}吧。大吾跟我提过你。我是米可利，以前是这座城市的道馆馆主。","Groudon and Kyogre will not stop until one of them falls, and Hoenn will fall with them. Long ago, only one Pokémon could end their fight: Rayquaza, who lives above the clouds.":"固拉多和盖欧卡不分出胜负是不会停下的，丰缘也会跟着毁灭。很久以前，能平息它们战斗的只有一只宝可梦：住在云层之上的烈空坐。","Rayquaza rests at the top of the Sky Pillar, on Route 131. Sail west from Route 128, across Routes 129 and 130.":"烈空坐在131号道路的天空柱顶端休息。从128号道路往西，穿过129号和130号道路就能到。","I will go ahead and unseal the tower's door. Meet me there, {player}!":"我先过去解开塔门的封印。我们在那里会合吧，{player}！","A long green Pokémon lies coiled at the very top of the pillar, as if it had slept here for a thousand years.":"一只修长的绿色宝可梦盘卧在天空柱的最顶端，仿佛已经在这里沉睡了一千年。","Rayquaza opened its eyes! It looked toward Sootopolis... and shot up into the clouds!":"烈空坐睁开了眼睛！它望向琉璃市的方向……然后冲进了云层！","It is flying to Sootopolis City. Hurry back!":"它正飞往琉璃市。快回去吧！","Rayquaza has come back to the top of the pillar. It looks down at you, waiting.":"烈空坐回到了天空柱的顶端。它俯视着你，像是在等待着什么。","Rayquaza is still there, watching you.":"烈空坐还在那里，注视着你。","The wind at the top of the Sky Pillar falls quiet.":"天空柱顶端的风静了下来。","The League awaits you at Ever Grande City. Go and show them the beauty I saw today.":"联盟在彩幽市等着你。去让他们见识一下我今天看到的那份美吧。","Wallace went to the Sky Pillar? Then go after him, {player}. I will keep watch over the city.":"米可利去天空柱了？那你快追上去吧，{player}。我会守着这座城市。","{player}! Look at them... If Groudon and Kyogre keep fighting, the rain and the drought will swallow all of Hoenn.":"{player}！你看它们……如果固拉多和盖欧卡继续打下去，暴雨和干旱会吞没整个丰缘。","There is someone who knows the old legends: Wallace, who once led this city's Gym. He went into the Cave of Origin, just behind me. Please, talk to him.":"有个人了解古老的传说：米可利，他以前是这座城市的道馆馆主。他进了我身后的觉醒祠堂。拜托你去找他谈谈。","The Gym's door is shut. A note on it says: \"Closed until the storm passes.\"":"道馆的门关着。上面贴着一张纸条：“暴风雨过去之前暂停开放。”","Yo, Champion! Juan uses Water-type Pokémon. Grass and Electric moves are your best friends here!":"嗨，未来的冠军！亚当用的是水属性宝可梦。在这里，草属性和电属性的招式就是你最好的朋友！","Watch out for his Kingdra: it is part Dragon, so only Dragon moves hit it hard. And slide carefully on the ice!":"小心他的刺龙王：它也是龙属性，只有龙属性招式才能重创它。还有，在冰上滑的时候要小心！","The Rain Badge is yours. It is the last of Hoenn's eight badges.":"雨滴徽章是你的了。这是丰缘八枚徽章中的最后一枚。","{player} received the Rain Badge from Juan!":"{player}从亚当那里得到了雨滴徽章！","With all eight Hoenn badges, every Pokémon will obey you, whatever its level.":"有了丰缘的全部八枚徽章，无论多少级的宝可梦都会听你的话。","And take TM03, Water Pulse. Its ripples can leave your opponent confused.":"还有，收下招式学习器03，水之波动。它的波纹有时会让对手混乱。","Now go east along Route 128 to Ever Grande City. The Pokémon League waits for you beyond Victory Road.":"现在沿着128号道路往东去彩幽市吧。宝可梦联盟就在冠军之路的另一头等着你。","The tower's door is sealed shut. Old letters are carved deep into the stone.":"塔门被封得死死的。石头上深深刻着古老的文字。","Dean":"迪恩","A storm like this is a swimmer's worst nightmare. Or best training!":"这种暴风雨是游泳选手最可怕的噩梦。也可以说是最好的训练！","I got pulled under...":"我被卷到水底下了……","Sootopolis City is inside that crater. You can only get in from under the water.":"琉璃市就在那个火山口里。只能从水底下进去。","The rain will not stop! Let us battle while we wait for it to clear.":"雨一直下个不停！趁着等雨停，我们来对战吧。","The dark water south of the crater is where the divers go down.":"潜水的人都是从火山口南边那片深色的海水下去的。","Merle":"默尔","The fish bite like crazy before a storm. What did I hook this time?":"暴风雨来之前，鱼咬钩咬得特别凶。这次我钓到什么了？","Snapped my line!":"鱼线断了！","My grandfather said the storms of legend came when the masters of land and sea fought.":"我爷爷说过，传说中的暴风雨，都是大地和海洋之主打起来的时候出现的。","Kyogre glares across the lake, calling down the rain.":"盖欧卡在湖中怒视着对岸，召唤着大雨。","Groudon roars, and the air around it burns with heat.":"固拉多发出咆哮，周围的空气热得发烫。","The sky is blue again! For a while I thought the sea and the land would swallow the whole city.":"天空又变蓝了！有一阵子我还以为大海和大地要把整座城市吞没了。","They say a Pokémon that lives in the sky calmed the storm. Sootopolis has never seen anything like it.":"听说是一只住在天上的宝可梦平息了暴风雨。琉璃市从来没见过这种事。","Sootopolis is built inside a crater. Without a Pokémon that can Dive or Fly, you cannot even get here!":"琉璃市建在火山口里。没有会潜水或飞翔的宝可梦，连来都来不了！","Max Potions and Revives. In a city at the bottom of a crater, it pays to be ready.":"全满药和活力碎片。住在火山口底部的城市，还是有备无患比较好。","The legends say the masters of land and sea once fought until the sky itself stepped in. I never thought I would see it.":"传说中，大地与海洋之主曾经一直打到天空亲自出手为止。我从没想过能亲眼看到。","Juan is the best Gym Leader in Hoenn! He even taught Wallace, and Wallace is amazing.":"亚当是丰缘最厉害的道馆馆主！他还当过米可利的老师呢，米可利超厉害的。","Olivia":"奥莉维亚","You crossed the ice without falling? How graceful. Let us see if your battling is as pretty.":"你走过冰面都没有摔倒？真优雅。让我看看你的对战是不是也一样漂亮。","Not a hair out of place, and still I lost...":"我连头发都没乱，竟然还是输了……","Juan says a battle should flow like water. Beauty and strength, together.":"亚当说过，对战应该像流水一样。美丽与力量，两者兼备。","Bethany":"贝瑟妮","My Azumarill is the cutest Water type in Hoenn! And the strongest!":"我的玛力露丽是丰缘最可爱的水属性宝可梦！也是最强的！","My darlings...":"我的宝贝们……","Azumarill's ears can hear the smallest ripple. Juan's Pokémon are just as sharp.":"玛力露丽的耳朵连最小的水波声都听得到。亚当的宝可梦也一样敏锐。","Slipping on the ice already? A battle will help you find your feet.":"已经在冰上打滑了？来场对战帮你站稳脚跟吧。","I am the one who slipped...":"摔倒的是我才对……","Slide until something stops you. The rocks on the ice are your friends.":"一直滑到被东西挡住为止。冰上的岩石就是你的好帮手。","Crissy":"克莉希","I came to Juan's Gym to learn the art of Water types. Watch this!":"我来亚当的道馆学习水属性的技艺。看好了！","I still have so much to learn.":"我要学的东西还多着呢。","Juan's Kingdra is part Dragon. Normal Water-type weaknesses do not work on it.":"亚当的刺龙王也是龙属性。水属性的一般弱点对它不管用。","Ah, so you are the Trainer who brought the sky's master to our city. I am Juan, the Leader of this Gym, and Wallace's teacher. Water and I move as one. Show me the elegance of the bond between you and your Pokémon!":"啊，原来你就是把天空之主带到我们城市的训练家。我是这座道馆的馆主亚当，也是米可利的老师。水与我融为一体。让我看看你和宝可梦之间那份优雅的羁绊吧！","Ahahaha! Splendid! Your battle washed over me like a great wave. I have nothing left to teach you.":"啊哈哈哈！精彩！你的对战就像巨浪一样朝我扑来。我已经没有什么可以教你的了。","Reese":"里斯","Heading west? The storm thins out the farther you swim. Battle me first!":"要往西去吗？越往西游，暴风雨就越小。先跟我对战吧！","Out of the storm and out of luck...":"躲过了暴风雨，却没躲过失败……","Past Route 130 is Route 131. You can see the Sky Pillar from there on a clear day.":"过了130号道路就是131号道路。天气好的时候，从那里能看到天空柱。","Tara":"塔拉","My Starmie's core shines like a star even in the rain!":"就算在雨中，我的宝石海星的核心也像星星一样闪耀！","My star went out...":"我的星星熄灭了……","A Starmie's core glows brighter the stronger it gets.":"宝石海星越强，它的核心就越亮。","This patch of sea is my training ground. Let us see what you have!":"这片海域是我的训练场。让我看看你的本事！","That was a real workout...":"这才叫真正的锻炼……","Katie":"凯蒂","The sun is out over here! Perfect weather for a battle!":"这边出太阳了！正是对战的好天气！","At least I have a nice tan...":"至少我晒出了漂亮的肤色……","Pacifidlog Town floats on the sea, just past Route 131.":"暮水镇就漂浮在131号道路过去一点的海面上。","I have unsealed the door of the Sky Pillar. Rayquaza sleeps at the very top. Go, {player}!":"我已经解开天空柱大门的封印了。烈空坐就在最顶层沉睡。去吧，{player}！","Kevin":"凯文","That tower is the Sky Pillar. Nobody has opened its door in ages. But first, a battle!":"那座塔就是天空柱。好多年都没人打开过它的门了。不过先来对战吧！","You swim and battle like a pro.":"你游泳和对战都像个高手。","They say a dragon of the sky sleeps at the top of the Sky Pillar.":"听说天空柱的顶端睡着一条天空之龙。","Talia":"塔莉亚","Pacifidlog is just west of here. Show me how strong you are before you go!":"暮水镇就在西边。走之前让我看看你有多强！","Sunk!":"沉下去了！","Pacifidlog has a Pokémon Center. Rest there before you climb the Sky Pillar.":"暮水镇有宝可梦中心。爬天空柱之前先去那里休息一下吧。","West of here the currents run so strong that nobody can swim against them. Maybe someday...":"从这里往西，海流强得谁都游不过去。也许总有一天……","I swam here from Route 131. The Sky Pillar is just east, on the island in the south.":"我是从131号道路游过来的。天空柱就在东边，在南边的那座岛上。","Our town was built on the backs of Corsola long ago, or so my grandmother told me. Now we live on logs.":"我奶奶说，很久以前我们的镇子是建在太阳珊瑚背上的。现在我们住在木头上。","The Sky Pillar? My father said its door has been sealed since before anyone can remember.":"天空柱？我爸爸说，它的门从没人记得的年代起就一直封着。","Sootopolis City. A town of white stone in the heart of an old crater.":"琉璃市。位于古老火山口中心的白石之城。","Pacifidlog Town. Where the morning sun shines on the floating logs.":"暮水镇。晨光洒落在漂浮木头上的小镇。","Look out of my window! There is an island out on Route 130 today. It is not on any map, you know.":"从我的窗户往外看！今天130号道路上有一座岛。那座岛可不在任何地图上哦。","Some days it is there, most days it is not. Go and see it before the sea takes it back!":"有些日子它在，大多数日子都不在。趁大海还没把它收回去，快去看看吧！","Some days I see an island from this window, out on Route 130. Not today, though.":"有些日子，我从这扇窗户能看到130号道路上有一座岛。不过今天看不到。","They say it shows itself to Trainers who bring the right Pokémon along. Try others with you, or come back tomorrow.":"听说只有带着合适的宝可梦的训练家才看得到它。换几只宝可梦带在身边试试，或者明天再来吧。","An island that is on no map. The grass is soft, and something small is moving in it.":"一座不在任何地图上的岛。草地软软的，里面有什么小东西在动。","Mirage Island. Tomorrow it may be gone again, but you were here.":"幻影岛。明天它也许又会消失，但你确实来过这里。","Some days an island with grass on it shows up out here. Other days there is only the sea.":"有些日子这里会冒出一座长着草的小岛，有些日子又只剩下大海。","I have trained for this tower for years. Let us see what you have!":"我为了这座塔训练了好多年。让我看看你的实力吧！","Only the strongest climb this tower. Show me you belong here!":"只有最强的人才能登上这座塔。证明你有资格站在这里吧！","My team is ready. Is yours?":"我的队伍已经准备好了。你的呢？","A new challenger? Do not expect me to go easy on you.":"新的挑战者？可别指望我会手下留情。","Every battle here is a test, and I intend to pass mine!":"在这里，每场对战都是考验，而我打算通过我的考验！","I heard about your streak. It ends with me!":"我听说你连胜的事了。就让我来终结它！","I see... You really are strong.":"原来如此……你真的很强。","My training was not enough...":"我的训练还不够……","What a battle! Keep climbing.":"真是一场好对战！继续往上爬吧。","Beaten... but I learned something today.":"输了……不过今天我学到了东西。","Your streak goes on. Impressive.":"你的连胜还在继续。真厉害。","So you are the one climbing my tower. I am Anabel, the Salon Maiden. Let me see how deep your bond with your Pokémon runs.":"原来正在攀登我这座塔的人就是你。我是沙龙女主人莉拉。让我看看你和宝可梦之间的羁绊有多深吧。","You came back. This time I will not hold anything back.":"你回来了。这次我会全力以赴。","...Impressive. Your Pokémon trust you completely.":"……真了不起。你的宝可梦完全信任你。","There is nothing left for me to test. You are truly strong.":"我已经没有什么可以考验你的了。你真的很强。","Welcome to the Battle Tower! This counter is for double battles.":"欢迎来到对战塔！这个柜台受理双打对战。","Welcome to the Battle Tower! This counter is for single battles.":"欢迎来到对战塔！这个柜台受理单打对战。","In the Battle Tower, you battle Trainers one after another. Win seven in a row to finish a set and earn Battle Points.":"在对战塔里，你要一个接一个地和训练家对战。连赢七场就完成一轮，可以得到对战点数。","Enter three Pokémon for single battles, or four for double battles. They must all be different species holding different items, and some legendary Pokémon cannot enter.":"单打要报名三只宝可梦，双打要报名四只。它们必须是不同种类、携带不同道具，而且有些传说宝可梦不能参加。","Here, Pokémon above level 50 battle at level 50, and items from the Bag cannot be used. Win or lose, your Pokémon will be just as they were.":"在这里，超过50级的宝可梦会以50级出战，而且不能使用背包里的道具。不论输赢，你的宝可梦都会保持原样。","Wins in a row: {n}. Your best: {best}.":"目前连胜：{n}场。最高纪录：{best}场。","Would you like to take the challenge?":"要接受挑战吗？","You need at least {n} Pokémon that can enter.":"你需要至少{n}只可以参加的宝可梦。","Cannot enter":"不能参加","Same species":"同种宝可梦","Same item":"道具重复","Choose Pokémon {k} of {n}.":"请选择第{k}只宝可梦（共{n}只）。","No. {k}":"第{k}只","Thank you. Please follow me to the battle room.":"谢谢。请跟我到对战室来。","The Salon Maiden has come to battle you herself!":"沙龙女主人亲自前来和你对战了！","Battle No. {n}! Here comes your opponent.":"第{n}场对战！对手来了。","Your streak is over. Wins in a row: {n}. Please try again!":"你的连胜结束了。连胜：{n}场。请再接再厉！","Anabel recognizes your strength. You earned the Silver Print!":"莉拉认可了你的实力。你得到了银色印记！","Anabel recognizes your strength. You earned the Gold Print!":"莉拉认可了你的实力。你得到了金色印记！","{player} earned {n} BP!":"{player}得到了{n}BP！","Congratulations! You won seven battles in a row!":"恭喜！你取得了七连胜！","Battle No. {n} is next. Will you keep going?":"下一场是第{n}场对战。要继续吗？","Retire":"放弃","You retired. Wins in a row: {n}.":"你放弃了挑战。连胜：{n}场。","Your streak goes on: next time, you will start from battle No. {n}.":"你的连胜会继续：下次将从第{n}场对战开始。","This is the Exchange Service Corner. Your Battle Points can be traded for prizes here.":"这里是兑换服务处。你可以用对战点数兑换奖品。","You have {n} BP. What would you like?":"你有{n}BP。想要什么呢？","Which one would you like?":"你想要哪一个？","{item} · {n} BP":"{item} · {n}BP","You do not have enough BP.":"你的BP不够。","The door to the battle room. Challengers must register at one of the counters first.":"通往对战室的门。挑战者必须先到柜台报名。","{player}! We meet again. I came to look at the stones along this shore.":"{player}！我们又见面了。我是来看这片岸边的石头的。","I heard what happened on Mt. Chimney. Team Magma wants more land, Team Aqua wants more sea... Either way, Hoenn would never be the same.":"我听说了烟囱山发生的事。熔岩队想要更多陆地，海洋队想要更多海洋……不管哪一方得逞，丰缘都会面目全非。","The weather has been strange lately, too: sudden droughts, sudden storms. North of here, Route 119 leads to the Weather Institute, where they study exactly that.":"最近的天气也很奇怪：一下子干旱，一下子暴雨。从这里往北，119号道路通往天气研究所，那里就在研究这件事。","Fortree City lies beyond it. Its Gym Leader, Winona, soars through the sky with her bird Pokémon. I am sure you will meet her soon.":"再往前就是茵郁市。那里的道馆馆主娜琪和她的鸟宝可梦一起在天空翱翔。我相信你很快就会见到她。","Until next time, {player}. Take good care of your Pokémon.":"下次见，{player}。好好照顾你的宝可梦。","{player}! You came to visit? The air here is so clean, I already feel stronger.":"{player}！你来看我啦？这里的空气好干净，我已经觉得自己变强了。","Ralts and I train every day. One day we will battle you again, and that time we will not lose!":"我和拉鲁拉丝每天都在训练。总有一天我们会再跟你对战，那时我们一定不会输！","Oh, {player}! The air in Verdanturf is so clean. Ralts and I go for a walk every morning.":"啊，{player}！绿荫镇的空气好干净。我和拉鲁拉丝每天早上都去散步。","Wally talks about you all the time. Thank you for being such a good friend to him.":"满充总是提起你。谢谢你对他这么好。","My boyfriend is digging a tunnel all the way from Rustboro, just so he can come and see me.":"我男朋友为了来见我，从卡那兹市一路挖隧道过来。","But they hit a rock nobody can break. He says only a Pokémon could smash it... I hope someone helps him.":"可是他们挖到了一块谁也敲不碎的岩石。他说只有宝可梦才能把它击碎……希望有人能帮帮他。","Wally's Aunt":"满充的阿姨","Lydia":"莉迪亚","The flowers along Route 117 are my favourite. My Pokémon love them too!":"117号道路边的花是我的最爱。我的宝可梦也很喜欢！","My petals fell...":"花瓣都掉了……","Roselia has a red rose on one hand and a blue one on the other. Their scent can make you sleepy!":"毒蔷薇一只手上是红玫瑰，另一只手上是蓝玫瑰。它们的香气会让人想睡觉！","Dylan":"迪伦","I run along this road every morning with Linoone. Keep up if you can!":"我每天早上都和直冲熊在这条路上跑步。跟得上就来吧！","Linoone runs very fast, but only in straight lines. Corners are its weak spot!":"直冲熊跑得很快，可是只会跑直线。转弯是它的弱点！","Volbeat and Illumise light up the night together. Want to see?":"电萤虫和甜甜萤会一起照亮夜空。想看看吗？","The lights went out...":"灯光熄灭了……","Volbeat follows the sweet scent of Illumise. At night they draw shapes in the sky with their lights.":"电萤虫会追着甜甜萤的香甜气味飞。到了晚上，它们会用光在夜空中画出图案。","Some people come all the way to Route 117 just for the flowers. I come for the quiet.":"有人专程来117号道路看花。我是来享受清静的。","The mountains around Verdanturf keep the ash from Mt. Chimney away. That is why our air is so clean!":"绿荫镇周围的群山挡住了烟囱山的火山灰。所以我们这里的空气才这么干净！","A sickly boy moved here not long ago. He walks with his Ralts every morning, and he looks better every day.":"前不久有个体弱的男孩搬来这里。他每天早上都和拉鲁拉丝散步，气色一天比一天好。","The Rusturf Tunnel goes west to Route 116 and Rustboro City. They stopped digging when they hit a rock too hard to break.":"石头隧道往西通往116号道路和卡那兹市。挖到一块硬得敲不碎的岩石后就停工了。","People come to Verdanturf to rest and get well. Even the Pokémon here seem calmer.":"大家来绿荫镇休养身体。连这里的宝可梦好像都比较安详。","Escape Rope takes you straight out of a cave. Handy in the Rusturf Tunnel!":"离洞绳能让你马上离开洞窟。在石头隧道里很好用！","Deandre":"迪安德烈","Mauville is right behind me. Show me what a Trainer from the big city can do!":"紫堇市就在我身后。让我看看大城市来的训练家有什么本事！","I should have stayed in town...":"我应该待在城里的……","You need a Pokémon that can Surf to cross the water. Then the whole road is yours.":"要渡过这片水，得有会冲浪的宝可梦。之后整条路就任你走了。","Barny":"巴尼","This channel is full of fish that bite. So are my Pokémon!":"这条水道里全是会咬人的鱼。我的宝可梦也一样！","Snapped my line...":"钓线断了……","Carvanha swim in packs and bite anything that comes too close. Mind your fingers when you Surf!":"利牙鱼成群游动，什么东西靠得太近都会被咬。冲浪的时候小心你的手指！","Chester":"切斯特","My birds watched you Surf all the way across. Now let us see how you battle!":"我的鸟宝可梦看着你一路冲浪过来。现在来看看你对战的本事！","Swellow fly south when the seasons change. They always come back to the same nest.":"季节变换时，大王燕会飞往南方。它们总会回到同一个巢。","I came over on a boat to have lunch on this side. Nobody bothers me here... until now!":"我坐船来对岸吃午饭。这里从来没人打扰我……直到现在！","Lunch is ruined...":"午饭泡汤了……","They say Route 119 gets so much rain that the grass grows taller than a person!":"听说119号道路雨下得特别多，草长得比人还高！","Do you like flowers? My Pokémon smell wonderful. Let me show you!":"你喜欢花吗？我的宝可梦可香了。让你见识一下！","Wilted...":"枯萎了……","Roselia's thorns are poisonous. Look, but do not touch!":"毒蔷薇的刺有毒。只能看，不能摸！","Route 117. West: Verdanturf Town. East: Mauville City.":"117号道路。西：绿荫镇。东：紫堇市。","Verdanturf Town. A town of fresh air, sheltered from the ash of Mt. Chimney.":"绿荫镇。空气清新，不受烟囱山火山灰影响的小镇。","Route 118. West: Mauville City. The road goes on across the water.":"118号道路。西：紫堇市。道路在水的另一边继续延伸。","North: Route 119, to the Weather Institute and Fortree City.":"北：119号道路，通往天气研究所和茵郁市。","Anna & Meg":"安娜和梅格","Our Plusle and Minun cheer each other on! They get stronger when they are together!":"我们的正电拍拍和负电拍拍会互相加油！它们在一起的时候会变得更强！","They cheered so hard...":"它们那么努力地加油了……","Plusle and Minun power each other up, side by side. Do you have a pair like that?":"正电拍拍和负电拍拍肩并肩时会互相增强力量。你也有这样的搭档吗？","Hmm... No Shroomish here either. I was so sure they lived in these woods...":"唔……这里也没有蘑蘑菇。我还以为它们一定住在这片森林里……","There you are, Devon researcher! Hand over the papers you are carrying, nice and easy.":"找到你了，得文公司的研究员！乖乖把你身上的文件交出来。","N-no! These are important! You there, please help me!":"不、不行！这些很重要！那边的，请帮帮我！","What? A kid wants to get in the way of Team Aqua? You asked for it!":"什么？一个小鬼想妨碍海洋队？这是你自找的！","Grr... You are tougher than you look. Fine, keep the papers. Team Aqua will not forget your face!":"可恶……你比看起来还厉害。好吧，文件就留给你。海洋队不会忘记你这张脸的！","Thank you! Those papers are very important to the Devon Corporation. Please, take this.":"谢谢你！这些文件对得文公司非常重要。请收下这个。","Team Aqua... I must warn the company. I will hurry back to Rustboro City!":"海洋队……我得通知公司。我要赶快回卡那兹市！","A Miracle Seed makes Grass-type moves stronger. Let your Pokémon hold it!":"奇迹种子能让草属性的招式变强。让宝可梦带着吧！","Oh, you are a Trainer? I found this in the woods, but I do not have any Grass-type Pokémon. Here, you have it!":"哦，你是训练家？我在森林里捡到了这个，可是我没有草属性的宝可梦。给你吧！","Welcome to the Pretty Petal flower shop! Flowers and berries make everybody smile.":"欢迎光临美丽花瓣花店！花和树果能让大家都露出笑容。","Welcome to the Pretty Petal flower shop! Our berries grow right outside. Here, a little gift for your Pokémon!":"欢迎光临美丽花瓣花店！我们的树果就种在门外。这个是送给你的宝可梦的小礼物！","Let a Pokémon hold an Oran Berry, and it will eat it in battle when its HP runs low.":"让宝可梦带着橙橙果，它在对战中HP变少时就会吃掉。","Devon Researcher":"得文公司的研究员","The sea breeze makes my Pokémon so lively! Let me show you!":"海风让我的宝可梦精神十足！让你见识一下！","Oh, the wind changed...":"哎呀，风向变了……","Lotad loves the rain. When it rains, it moves twice as fast!":"莲叶童子最喜欢下雨。一下雨，它的速度就会变成两倍！","Billy":"比利","I have been waiting for a strong Trainer to walk by. That is you, right?":"我一直在等厉害的训练家经过。就是你吧？","You really were strong!":"你果然很强！","Seedot looks just like an acorn. Sometimes I forget it is a Pokémon!":"橡实果长得跟橡子一模一样。有时候我都忘了它是宝可梦！","Darian":"达利安","The fish are not biting. A battle will pass the time!":"鱼都不上钩。来场对战打发时间吧！","Even my Magikarp gave it everything...":"就连我的鲤鱼王都拼尽全力了……","One day this Magikarp will be a Gyarados. I just have to be patient.":"总有一天这只鲤鱼王会变成暴鲤龙。我只要有耐心就好。","That cottage on the beach belongs to Mr. Briney. He was a famous sailor once. Now he just watches the waves with his Wingull.":"海滩上那间小屋是哈奇老人的。他以前是有名的水手，现在只和他的长翅鸥一起看海浪。","Ahoy! I am Briney. I sailed every sea in Hoenn in my day, but these old bones have hung up their sea legs. Now Peeko and I just enjoy the view.":"喂！我是哈奇。我年轻时航行过丰缘的每一片海，不过这把老骨头已经不出海了。现在我只和Peeko一起看看风景。","Peeko the Wingull flaps its wings and cries happily.":"长翅鸥Peeko开心地拍着翅膀叫了起来。","Lyle":"莱尔","The woods are full of Bug Pokémon. And I have caught the best ones!":"森林里到处都是虫属性宝可梦。而我抓到的是最棒的！","Bugs are still the best!":"虫子还是最棒的！","Wurmple turns into Silcoon or Cascoon. Which one? That is the big mystery!":"刺尾虫会变成甲壳茧或盾甲茧。会是哪一种呢？这就是最大的谜团！","Rustboro is just across the bridge! But first, a battle!":"过了桥就是卡那兹市！不过先来对战吧！","Hmph, you are good.":"哼，你挺厉害的。","There is a school for Trainers in Rustboro. I learned everything there!":"卡那兹市有一所训练家学校。我所有的本领都是在那里学的！","Three Magikarp, three times the fun!":"三只鲤鱼王，三倍的乐趣！","Splash, splash, splash...":"跃起、跃起、跃起……","This river is full of Magikarp. Where do they all come from?":"这条河里到处都是鲤鱼王。它们都是从哪里来的啊？","I caught a Taillow in the woods! Well, it caught me first...":"我在森林里抓到了傲骨燕！嗯，其实是它先抓到我的……","Ow, ow, ow!":"痛痛痛！","Taillow is small, but it never gives up, even against a bigger foe.":"傲骨燕虽然个子小，就算对手比它大也绝不放弃。","Berries grow on trees all over Hoenn. Pick them, and a new crop grows the next day!":"丰缘到处都有长着树果的树。摘下来以后，第二天又会结出新的！","Route 104. North: Petalburg Woods. East: Petalburg City.":"104号道路。北：橙华森林。东：橙华市。","Route 104. North: Rustboro City. South: Petalburg Woods.":"104号道路。北：卡那兹市。南：橙华森林。","Gina & Mia":"吉娜和米亚","We are twins, so we always battle together! Two against two!":"我们是双胞胎，所以总是一起对战！二对二！","We lost together too...":"我们也是一起输的……","When we battle side by side, we think the same thoughts. Most of the time.":"我们并肩对战的时候，想的都是同一件事。大部分时候是。","Sunny":"大晴天","The opponents":"查看对手","Ranks":"等级","We hope to see you on stage soon!":"期待早日在舞台上见到你！","In the Dance round, each Pokémon leads one dance and copies the others: step in time with the beat.":"在舞蹈审查中，每只宝可梦领舞一次，其余时候跟着跳：要踩准节拍。","In the Acting round, your Pokémon performs its moves for one of three judges, four times. The most hearts in all wins a ribbon.":"在演技审查中，宝可梦对三位评审之一使出招式，共四次。总分最多的能得到奖章。","Would you like to enter a contest?":"要参加比赛吗？","Which category?":"哪一个类别？","Which Pokémon will enter?":"派哪只宝可梦参赛？","Which rank?":"哪一个等级？","Thank you! Please go on stage. The contest begins now!":"谢谢！请上台。比赛马上开始！","{mon} came in at number {n}. Train hard and try again!":"{mon}得了第 {n} 名。好好练习，再来挑战吧！","Congratulations! {mon} won the {ribbon}!":"恭喜！{mon}得到了{ribbon}！","Congratulations! {mon} won again!":"恭喜！{mon}又赢了！","Each flavor brings out one quality: spicy for Cool, dry for Beauty, sweet for Cute, bitter for Smart, sour for Tough.":"每种口味提升一种状态：辣是帅气，涩是美丽，甜是可爱，苦是聪明，酸是强壮。","Choose up to {n} berries.":"最多选 {n} 颗树果。","Feed it to which Pokémon?":"喂给哪只宝可梦？","{mon}'s {list} went up!":"{mon}的{list}提升了！","{mon} looks completely full.":"{mon}看起来已经吃得饱饱的了。","Receptionist":"接待员","In the Acting round, watch the judges. A judge nobody else picks gives the most hearts, and filling a judge's voltage is worth even more.":"演技审查时要注意评审。没有别人选的评审给的心最多，让评审的兴奋度满了更有价值。","A poster: \"Cool, Beauty, Cute, Smart, Tough. Which will your Pokémon be?\"":"海报：“帅气、美丽、可爱、聪明、强壮。你的宝可梦是哪一种？”","Level 50":"50 级","Anna":"安娜","Felix":"费利克斯","{mon} received the Artist Ribbon!":"{mon}得到了肖像奖章！","Your team received the Champion Ribbon!":"你的队伍得到了冠军奖章！","Fifty-six wins in a row! Your Pokémon received the Winning Ribbon!":"五十六连胜！你的宝可梦得到了优胜奖章！"},"zh-Hans",""]);
